(2585915, 357929, 46330, '<td valign="top">I like the color palette here but the flower on the right would be better either completely excluded or fully in the frame.  Cutting it off like that just makes it look like sloppy composition.  I''d suggest moving the camera slightly to the right to move the rock to the bottom left hand corner and fully include the flower in the upper right corner balancing the composition.</td>', 'I like the color palette here but the flower on the right would be better either completely excluded or fully in the frame.  Cutting it off like that just makes it look like sloppy composition.  I''d suggest moving the camera slightly to the right to move the rock to the bottom left hand corner and fully include the flower in the upper right corner balancing the composition.', '2006-07-05 01:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
