(2588703, 355500, 17485, '<td valign="top">The wavy lines created by the railing on the left draw my eye away from the subject as does the orange/bright light in the background.</td>', 'The wavy lines created by the railing on the left draw my eye away from the subject as does the orange/bright light in the background.', '2006-07-05 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
