(2590510, 355634, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely night scene. I like the repetition of the 3 buildings and the reflections. Then there''s that surreal huge work of art in the water, very cool!</td>', 'Lovely night scene. I like the repetition of the 3 buildings and the reflections. Then there''s that surreal huge work of art in the water, very cool!', '2006-07-05 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
