(2590546, 358395, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and you were clever to use a border the same colour as the dividers between the windows. The more I look at this the more I like it. Perfect placement of the statue in the frame and it suits the challenge well.</td>', 'Very nice, and you were clever to use a border the same colour as the dividers between the windows. The more I look at this the more I like it. Perfect placement of the statue in the frame and it suits the challenge well.', '2006-07-05 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
