(2590761, 356837, 55199, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I don''t know what a Mojito is, and the organic matter in the bottom of the drink looks quite unappealing. Perhaps the person who drinks this will become stationary?  Image would be better if we could see the rest of the top of the glass and straw.</td>', 'Unfortunately I don''t know what a Mojito is, and the organic matter in the bottom of the drink looks quite unappealing. Perhaps the person who drinks this will become stationary?  Image would be better if we could see the rest of the top of the glass and straw.', '2006-07-05 23:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590782, 355867, 55199, '<td valign="top">Thats a unique grape arbor.  Good choice of subject.</td>', 'Thats a unique grape arbor.  Good choice of subject.', '2006-07-05 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
