(2590894, 358513, 29513, '<td valign="top">I love that expression.  Photographers can be soooo cranky.  :)  I like the B&amp;W and the crop that includes the video camera, too.</td>', 'I love that expression.  Photographers can be soooo cranky.  :)  I like the B&W and the crop that includes the video camera, too.', '2006-07-06 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590911, 358574, 55199, '<td valign="top">Thats very pretty.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Thats very pretty.  Nice composition.', '2006-07-06 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590914, 355434, 61030, '<td valign="top">The sky has great color, and I like the effect you were going for; the statue is a little hard to make out though because of the figures standing around the cross.  If there wasn''t a title/caption for this photo it would be difficult to figure out what the message is.</td>', 'The sky has great color, and I like the effect you were going for; the statue is a little hard to make out though because of the figures standing around the cross.  If there wasn''t a title/caption for this photo it would be difficult to figure out what the message is.', '2006-07-06 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590927, 358674, 61030, '<td valign="top">It would be really difficult to understand this photo without a title.</td>', 'It would be really difficult to understand this photo without a title.', '2006-07-06 00:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590940, 355732, 55199, '<td valign="top">No wind that day.  Composition is good.  There is a distracting rectangle to the right of the foremost windmill; looks like a reflection.</td>', 'No wind that day.  Composition is good.  There is a distracting rectangle to the right of the foremost windmill; looks like a reflection.', '2006-07-06 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590949, 358293, 61030, '<td valign="top">I wish that the eagle were a little bit more in focus, but good shot!</td>', 'I wish that the eagle were a little bit more in focus, but good shot!', '2006-07-06 00:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590953, 358305, 55199, '<td valign="top">Colors look off (the skin is orange), and the scrambler is going about 18 mph.</td>', 'Colors look off (the skin is orange), and the scrambler is going about 18 mph.', '2006-07-06 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590959, 357786, 61030, '<td valign="top">Needs more depth of field in my opinion. =)</td>', 'Needs more depth of field in my opinion. =)', '2006-07-06 00:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590961, 356263, 61030, '<td valign="top">Work on the focus.</td>', 'Work on the focus.', '2006-07-06 00:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591023, 356493, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is awesome, looks like some distant planet.<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'That is awesome, looks like some distant planet. Great shot.', '2006-07-06 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591127, 354880, 40912, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous... good luck - hope to see it ribbon. :)</td>', 'This is gorgeous... good luck - hope to see it ribbon. :)', '2006-07-06 01:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591264, 357520, 60287, '<td valign="top">creepy...</td>', 'creepy...', '2006-07-06 01:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591493, 356236, 49356, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Capturing Rainier clearly from Seattle can be a challenge. I love that the Space Needle is so prominent in the foreground.  I also like how the everything seems to get smaller from the Space Needle as it leads your eye to Mt. Rainier.</td>', 'Very well done!  Capturing Rainier clearly from Seattle can be a challenge. I love that the Space Needle is so prominent in the foreground.  I also like how the everything seems to get smaller from the Space Needle as it leads your eye to Mt. Rainier.', '2006-07-06 02:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591600, 358641, 50034, '<td valign="top">New attraction at Sea World...Girl Rides Whale-Sized Dog!  "Roll-Over, Shamu, and splash the front row.  Bark, Shamu!  Stay, Shamu, Stay!"</td>', 'New attraction at Sea World...Girl Rides Whale-Sized Dog!  "Roll-Over, Shamu, and splash the front row.  Bark, Shamu!  Stay, Shamu, Stay!"', '2006-07-06 02:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591602, 356042, 54292, '<td valign="top">Great Colours.</td>', 'Great Colours.', '2006-07-06 02:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591609, 358097, 50034, '<td valign="top">"Hey, Buddy, looks like one of your seeds went a-travelin''!"</td>', '"Hey, Buddy, looks like one of your seeds went a-travelin''!"', '2006-07-06 02:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591693, 357840, 39484, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and concept.  In general, DPC''er vote down on images where the foreground is blurred and the background is sharp,  This is not always true, but a generalization.  Here, it looks like you got your focus on the yellow swing. I would think about focusing on the red swing and setting the aperture to something like f/13 or higher so that the depth of field falls off gradually at the blue swing.</td>', 'Nice colors and concept.  In general, DPC''er vote down on images where the foreground is blurred and the background is sharp,  This is not always true, but a generalization.  Here, it looks like you got your focus on the yellow swing. I would think about focusing on the red swing and setting the aperture to something like f/13 or higher so that the depth of field falls off gradually at the blue swing.', '2006-07-06 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591698, 358674, 39484, '<td valign="top">This needs a bit more tonal depth in my opinion.  Try adjustment layer curves or levels.  Nice composition.</td>', 'This needs a bit more tonal depth in my opinion.  Try adjustment layer curves or levels.  Nice composition.', '2006-07-06 02:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591702, 357404, 39484, '<td valign="top">640 px on the longest side would help.  Use the save for web function in photoshop. :)</td>', '640 px on the longest side would help.  Use the save for web function in photoshop. :)', '2006-07-06 02:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591708, 358376, 39484, '<td valign="top">Image is original.  Needs some sharpening. :)</td>', 'Image is original.  Needs some sharpening. :)', '2006-07-06 02:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
