(2592675, 357350, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the warm tones in this.  The one thing I''m not comfortable with in the composition is the sky in the background.  Don''t know if you could have changed your position to get more elevated, or move to your left.  By scrolling down on this voting page I can "crop" the image to see what it looks like without the sky and communication tower. The reason I mention getting more elevated is to try and not lose the left pine tree by pulling the top of the image down some.  Take a peek for yourself...see what you think.  JMO of course.  I still like it and think it''s one of the better images I''ve seen in the challenge thus far (rated 31 of 284).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the warm tones in this.  The one thing I''m not comfortable with in the composition is the sky in the background.  Don''t know if you could have changed your position to get more elevated, or move to your left.  By scrolling down on this voting page I can "crop" the image to see what it looks like without the sky and communication tower. The reason I mention getting more elevated is to try and not lose the left pine tree by pulling the top of the image down some.  Take a peek for yourself...see what you think.  JMO of course.  I still like it and think it''s one of the better images I''ve seen in the challenge thus far (rated 31 of 284). Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
