(2592710, 357704, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did that, but the way this worked out I just finished voting on the image titled "On Sunday, this excavator is .................".<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=358237" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/517/thumb/358237.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/517/thumb/358237.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/517/thumb/358237.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Then I see this image and the title is "At Rest".  Too funny!  ;^)<br/> <br/>Actually, I like this tighter shot better.  A little easier to isolate the subject (less busy).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-19 08:21:33.</i></td>', 'I don''t know how you did that, but the way this worked out I just finished voting on the image titled "On Sunday, this excavator is .................".   Then I see this image and the title is "At Rest".  Too funny!  ;^) Actually, I like this tighter shot better.  A little easier to isolate the subject (less busy). Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 10:14:02.000000', '2006-07-19 09:21:33.000000', 1),
