(2592766, 357441, 30049, '<td valign="top">Emotive shot.  I hope you made a contribution after getting his image.<br/>In some small way I feel like this image is a bit exploitive.  JMO, and I know all the legal mumbo jumbo about his being in public, etc...but still.<br/> <br/>As for the image qualities I''m finding the background just a little distracting.  Perhaps the people walking by add to the context of this man''s plight, but a step or two to the left would make this a stronger portrait shot IMO.  The exposure and details of the image subject are very well done.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Emotive shot.  I hope you made a contribution after getting his image.In some small way I feel like this image is a bit exploitive.  JMO, and I know all the legal mumbo jumbo about his being in public, etc...but still. As for the image qualities I''m finding the background just a little distracting.  Perhaps the people walking by add to the context of this man''s plight, but a step or two to the left would make this a stronger portrait shot IMO.  The exposure and details of the image subject are very well done. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
