(2592778, 356486, 30049, '<td valign="top">Funny one.  This would have really jumped out on a flat black background, or black with glass if you wanted the reflection.  The wood grain is distracting.  Nice idea.  Good luck.</td>', 'Funny one.  This would have really jumped out on a flat black background, or black with glass if you wanted the reflection.  The wood grain is distracting.  Nice idea.  Good luck.', '2006-07-06 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592780, 355873, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey, this would have worked wonderfully for the ''Perspective'' challenge!!  It DOES look like trolley tracks!  ;^)</td>', 'Hey, this would have worked wonderfully for the ''Perspective'' challenge!!  It DOES look like trolley tracks!  ;^)', '2006-07-06 10:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592783, 358287, 59195, '<td valign="top">Nice but the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'Nice but the horizon is tilted.', '2006-07-06 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592834, 358241, 60873, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2006-07-06 10:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592850, 358695, 60873, '<td valign="top">wow, this even looks old</td>', 'wow, this even looks old', '2006-07-06 10:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592858, 358612, 61564, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Good Job</td>', 'I really like this shot. Good Job', '2006-07-06 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592874, 355900, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice compa and perspective. Needs a bit more contrast. to make an impact.</td>', 'Nice compa and perspective. Needs a bit more contrast. to make an impact.', '2006-07-06 10:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592888, 358096, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice wide-angle lens.  Circular polarizer too?  Interesting how the grass appears mowed around this old rail car.  Good color, fairly simple subject, crisp...should do well!  ;^)</td>', 'Nice wide-angle lens.  Circular polarizer too?  Interesting how the grass appears mowed around this old rail car.  Good color, fairly simple subject, crisp...should do well!  ;^)', '2006-07-06 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592891, 358426, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute pic.  Nice focus where it counts.  Not quite sure how this fits into a ''Stationary'' challenge?</td>', 'Cute pic.  Nice focus where it counts.  Not quite sure how this fits into a ''Stationary'' challenge?', '2006-07-06 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592899, 358582, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice scenic location.  Overall you''ve done a nice job on exposure and composition.  Some haze in your shot however.  A UV filter would help as would a minor contrast adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a nice scenic location.  Overall you''ve done a nice job on exposure and composition.  Some haze in your shot however.  A UV filter would help as would a minor contrast adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 11:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592901, 355889, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the boat with wheels in the back left.  ;^)</td>', 'I like the boat with wheels in the back left.  ;^)', '2006-07-06 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592903, 357443, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at.  Well put together.  Colors saturated fine. Perhaps a little high on contrast?  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting to look at.  Well put together.  Colors saturated fine. Perhaps a little high on contrast?  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592907, 356502, 56744, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I think it was better not so centered.</td>', 'Nice picture. I think it was better not so centered.', '2006-07-06 11:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592911, 355114, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, if the winds blowing don''t they move?  ;^)  Very nice looking garden.  The way you''ve put this together is nice with the leading lines, etc...  I think you went a bit too far on desaturating the green.</td>', 'Well, if the winds blowing don''t they move?  ;^)  Very nice looking garden.  The way you''ve put this together is nice with the leading lines, etc...  I think you went a bit too far on desaturating the green.', '2006-07-06 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592913, 357704, 56744, '<td valign="top">Good catch. Maby some more saturation turns the picture much more vibrant</td>', 'Good catch. Maby some more saturation turns the picture much more vibrant', '2006-07-06 11:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592914, 357518, 30049, '<td valign="top">Has a documentary feel to it.  Perhaps a little more space for the boat would have been better.  Some nice clouds in the sky but they''re washed out.  A polarizer would have kept some detail for you there.  Image is a little flat - slight boost in contrast would help with that.  Also I think it''s underexposed some - levels or curves could help bring that back up.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Has a documentary feel to it.  Perhaps a little more space for the boat would have been better.  Some nice clouds in the sky but they''re washed out.  A polarizer would have kept some detail for you there.  Image is a little flat - slight boost in contrast would help with that.  Also I think it''s underexposed some - levels or curves could help bring that back up. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592922, 358519, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised those rims are still on it!  ;^)  Your choice of B/W is good to eliminate distrations in color that this scene presented I''m sure.  Lighting is somewhat harsh and the highlights appear to be blown out a little.  The angle is ok...did you try and get lower to the ground?  Might have been an interesting take.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m surprised those rims are still on it!  ;^)  Your choice of B/W is good to eliminate distrations in color that this scene presented I''m sure.  Lighting is somewhat harsh and the highlights appear to be blown out a little.  The angle is ok...did you try and get lower to the ground?  Might have been an interesting take.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-06 11:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592923, 355118, 56744, '<td valign="top">Good! Maybe some light on the king will give more confront.</td>', 'Good! Maybe some light on the king will give more confront.', '2006-07-06 11:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
