(2597143, 355939, 58840, '<td valign="top">this is one of the most adorable pictures i have ever seen! Everything about it is perfect, especially the expression on her face!  Definite 10 from me!</td>', 'this is one of the most adorable pictures i have ever seen! Everything about it is perfect, especially the expression on her face!  Definite 10 from me!', '2006-07-07 12:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
