(2597373, 358159, 61679, '<td valign="top">How true, how true.</td>', 'How true, how true.', '2006-07-07 13:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597391, 358366, 61679, '<td valign="top">I almost rated this lower because I thought the steeple was tilted but looking closer at the roofline to the right, it actually may be.  I like how busy this photo is for being stationary.  Try making a vertical crop retaining the steeple and the bird (but loosing the light in the lower right) and I think you will see a much stronger image. Still giving this a 7</td>', 'I almost rated this lower because I thought the steeple was tilted but looking closer at the roofline to the right, it actually may be.  I like how busy this photo is for being stationary.  Try making a vertical crop retaining the steeple and the bird (but loosing the light in the lower right) and I think you will see a much stronger image. Still giving this a 7', '2006-07-07 13:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597401, 354819, 61679, '<td valign="top">Tough balancing act between the highlights and shadows.  Shooting this at a different time of day may help better define the greens on the statue and bring out the face features. 5</td>', 'Tough balancing act between the highlights and shadows.  Shooting this at a different time of day may help better define the greens on the statue and bring out the face features. 5', '2006-07-07 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597413, 358011, 61679, '<td valign="top">Moving a little to the left might have allowed you to leave what ever that is propped against the fence out of the picture.  Since that object is your major highlight, removing it could provide added room during post processing to make the colors of the car (black tires, red rust, green paint) look a little richer. I think moving to the left would have helped the composition as well. 4</td>', 'Moving a little to the left might have allowed you to leave what ever that is propped against the fence out of the picture.  Since that object is your major highlight, removing it could provide added room during post processing to make the colors of the car (black tires, red rust, green paint) look a little richer. I think moving to the left would have helped the composition as well. 4', '2006-07-07 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
