(2597767, 358289, 39598, '<td valign="top">I''m just watching "Conan the Barbarian", and so this photo has taken on a disturbing quality for me.<br/>Not that it wasn''t disturbing, to begin with.<br/>There''s something about the composition which doesn''t do it for me either.<br/>Like it would benefit more from a rule of thirds adjustment.</td>', 'I''m just watching "Conan the Barbarian", and so this photo has taken on a disturbing quality for me.Not that it wasn''t disturbing, to begin with.There''s something about the composition which doesn''t do it for me either.Like it would benefit more from a rule of thirds adjustment.', '2006-07-07 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597772, 355939, 40019, '<td valign="top">LOVE the expression on her face!!  Great background color.  Fun picture - nicely done!</td>', 'LOVE the expression on her face!!  Great background color.  Fun picture - nicely done!', '2006-07-07 15:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597773, 356171, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great tonality in the conversion - nicely done.</td>', 'Great tonality in the conversion - nicely done.', '2006-07-07 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597775, 355553, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and post-processing!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great lighting and post-processing!  Nicely done!', '2006-07-07 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597776, 356965, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and deep colours.<br/>The bars are a bit distracting.<br/>I might have asked permission (or would have snuck in, more than likely) to take the photos without them.</td>', 'I like the contrast and deep colours.The bars are a bit distracting.I might have asked permission (or would have snuck in, more than likely) to take the photos without them.', '2006-07-07 15:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597778, 357085, 61679, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh and the crop is too tight. 4</td>', 'The lighting is harsh and the crop is too tight. 4', '2006-07-07 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597780, 356433, 40019, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What an incredibly sharp image!  Great shot!</td>', 'WOW!  What an incredibly sharp image!  Great shot!', '2006-07-07 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597781, 354917, 61679, '<td valign="top">Stuffed...Steadfast...Stationary....Blurry and not well defined. 4</td>', 'Stuffed...Steadfast...Stationary....Blurry and not well defined. 4', '2006-07-07 15:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597782, 358196, 23294, '<td valign="top">cool effect.  Not just another pet snapshot this has some art to it.  Like the colors a lot in this and the composition besides.</td>', 'cool effect.  Not just another pet snapshot this has some art to it.  Like the colors a lot in this and the composition besides.', '2006-07-07 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597783, 356464, 23294, '<td valign="top">Great focus here, my main concern is the backround is a bit distracting at least for me.</td>', 'Great focus here, my main concern is the backround is a bit distracting at least for me.', '2006-07-07 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597788, 357796, 23294, '<td valign="top">Looks like there''s plenty going on to not be bored with.  It''s a little dark.  It definately gives the feel of stationary though.</td>', 'Looks like there''s plenty going on to not be bored with.  It''s a little dark.  It definately gives the feel of stationary though.', '2006-07-07 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597790, 358135, 39598, '<td valign="top">The flash shadow puts me off this photo, and it kills (pardon the pun) what could otherwise be a good idea.<br/>Also, the column of the headstone would benefit from being pictured straight on. The skew angle is off-putting.<br/>Other than that, it also seems slightly over-sharpened.<br/>But good luck none-the-less.</td>', 'The flash shadow puts me off this photo, and it kills (pardon the pun) what could otherwise be a good idea.Also, the column of the headstone would benefit from being pictured straight on. The skew angle is off-putting.Other than that, it also seems slightly over-sharpened.But good luck none-the-less.', '2006-07-07 15:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597791, 356158, 61679, '<td valign="top">A little sharper focus on the man and the penguin and this would rock. 7</td>', 'A little sharper focus on the man and the penguin and this would rock. 7', '2006-07-07 15:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597794, 358376, 23294, '<td valign="top">what is the big black splotch on the ground there?  Interesting how the only full face is of the girl.  They definately have a pirate theme going on don''t they.</td>', 'what is the big black splotch on the ground there?  Interesting how the only full face is of the girl.  They definately have a pirate theme going on don''t they.', '2006-07-07 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597795, 356637, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice image but it doesn''t really scream stationary. 6</td>', 'Nice image but it doesn''t really scream stationary. 6', '2006-07-07 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597796, 355690, 23294, '<td valign="top">While that sky is pretty amazing, it''s probably not stationary.</td>', 'While that sky is pretty amazing, it''s probably not stationary.', '2006-07-07 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597798, 356907, 61679, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the fence post vertical. 6</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the fence post vertical. 6', '2006-07-07 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597799, 357643, 23294, '<td valign="top">I think the grain effect works here, I would have liked it to be a little more evenly spread, there seem to be kind of clumps and perhaps patterns in them.  There''s definately horizontal lines brought out in the top of the sky.</td>', 'I think the grain effect works here, I would have liked it to be a little more evenly spread, there seem to be kind of clumps and perhaps patterns in them.  There''s definately horizontal lines brought out in the top of the sky.', '2006-07-07 15:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597800, 358316, 61679, '<td valign="top">The butterfly in the background is distracting.  6</td>', 'The butterfly in the background is distracting.  6', '2006-07-07 15:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597801, 354860, 23294, '<td valign="top">I think a little less exposure would bring out the photo here, possibly more saturation to make the wheel barrow pop out more.</td>', 'I think a little less exposure would bring out the photo here, possibly more saturation to make the wheel barrow pop out more.', '2006-07-07 15:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597802, 357699, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice image but it doesn''t really convey stationary. 6</td>', 'Nice image but it doesn''t really convey stationary. 6', '2006-07-07 15:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597803, 355732, 23294, '<td valign="top">stationary objects moved by non-stationary things is an interesting take on the challenge.  I hope you''re not getting any crooked horizon comments cause those things look pretty vertical to me :-)</td>', 'stationary objects moved by non-stationary things is an interesting take on the challenge.  I hope you''re not getting any crooked horizon comments cause those things look pretty vertical to me :-)', '2006-07-07 15:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597806, 357823, 23294, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit lower composition to rid the photo of the darkness on the top would help it I think.  The setting is pretty good and the DOF is nice as well.</td>', 'A tiny bit lower composition to rid the photo of the darkness on the top would help it I think.  The setting is pretty good and the DOF is nice as well.', '2006-07-07 15:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597807, 357998, 61679, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t convey stationary to me.  He may be squating and not moving but his hands are causing all sorts of water movement and direction. 5</td>', 'Doesn''t convey stationary to me.  He may be squating and not moving but his hands are causing all sorts of water movement and direction. 5', '2006-07-07 15:40:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2597810, 356429, 39598, '<td valign="top">What to say...<br/>The sock device certainly is stationary.<br/>And so are the curtains.<br/>Other than that the photo is lacking punch, and it doesn''t grab my attention.<br/>Better luck next time.</td>', 'What to say...The sock device certainly is stationary.And so are the curtains.Other than that the photo is lacking punch, and it doesn''t grab my attention.Better luck next time.', '2006-07-07 15:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597813, 356867, 23294, '<td valign="top">the fact that his foot is not settled gives me the impression that he was in the process of getting into the tube.  It''s a cool shot, but I don''t think it''s convincing as far as the challenge is concerned.</td>', 'the fact that his foot is not settled gives me the impression that he was in the process of getting into the tube.  It''s a cool shot, but I don''t think it''s convincing as far as the challenge is concerned.', '2006-07-07 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597814, 358365, 61679, '<td valign="top">Average image - nothing special about the sepia conversion - nothing really wrong either.</td>', 'Average image - nothing special about the sepia conversion - nothing really wrong either.', '2006-07-07 15:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597816, 358515, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, and the composition.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I like the colours, and the composition.Good luck!', '2006-07-07 15:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597817, 355916, 23294, '<td valign="top">really awesome, my fave so far.  The possitioning of the deer here is great and the city in the far backround is key.  There could a bit more DOF so that the city could be made out a little better, but I really like this shot.</td>', 'really awesome, my fave so far.  The possitioning of the deer here is great and the city in the far backround is key.  There could a bit more DOF so that the city could be made out a little better, but I really like this shot.', '2006-07-07 15:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597819, 355900, 61679, '<td valign="top">The top of the left bottle blends into the background and takes away from the effectivness of this image.  The soft focus might not work for a lot of the voters but it works for me. 6</td>', 'The top of the left bottle blends into the background and takes away from the effectivness of this image.  The soft focus might not work for a lot of the voters but it works for me. 6', '2006-07-07 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597823, 358460, 23294, '<td valign="top">Looks really oversharpened.  I would also move the composition slightly to the left to include more of the guy''s shoulder or at least all of his hat.</td>', 'Looks really oversharpened.  I would also move the composition slightly to the left to include more of the guy''s shoulder or at least all of his hat.', '2006-07-07 15:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597824, 354979, 61679, '<td valign="top">This would make a better stationery entry.  6</td>', 'This would make a better stationery entry.  6', '2006-07-07 15:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597829, 358408, 61679, '<td valign="top">or sloppy painter.  Hard to see the motionless street artist in this image. 5</td>', 'or sloppy painter.  Hard to see the motionless street artist in this image. 5', '2006-07-07 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597830, 356857, 23294, '<td valign="top">the tonal range in this image looks kinda flat, there could be more contrast to it.  Dropping down a little lower might have gotten rid of most of the visible road in the backround.</td>', 'the tonal range in this image looks kinda flat, there could be more contrast to it.  Dropping down a little lower might have gotten rid of most of the visible road in the backround.', '2006-07-07 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597832, 355925, 39598, '<td valign="top">Your crew-cut crop is a bit too uncomfortable for my liking.<br/>Good luck to you anyway.<br/>And feel free to pass on my wishes of good luck to the force members you pictured.<br/>We''re praying for them.</td>', 'Your crew-cut crop is a bit too uncomfortable for my liking.Good luck to you anyway.And feel free to pass on my wishes of good luck to the force members you pictured.We''re praying for them.', '2006-07-07 15:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597836, 357443, 23294, '<td valign="top">too much processing to my taste, i''m not sure if it''s the sharpening, or some kind of filter.  I think the garbage scattered around actually helps this shot, but I couldn''t tell you why.</td>', 'too much processing to my taste, i''m not sure if it''s the sharpening, or some kind of filter.  I think the garbage scattered around actually helps this shot, but I couldn''t tell you why.', '2006-07-07 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597838, 357393, 61679, '<td valign="top">Although the big boat is waiting and motionless, the single boat is very much in motion and demands to be the primary focus of this image.  The top third of the image is also a distraction. 4</td>', 'Although the big boat is waiting and motionless, the single boat is very much in motion and demands to be the primary focus of this image.  The top third of the image is also a distraction. 4', '2006-07-07 15:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597841, 358693, 61679, '<td valign="top">He looks like he is moving with the facial blur.  Not a strong challenge subject.</td>', 'He looks like he is moving with the facial blur.  Not a strong challenge subject.', '2006-07-07 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597849, 357410, 23294, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.</td>', 'Powerful image.', '2006-07-07 15:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
