(2597854, 358477, 39598, '<td valign="top">I''ve never had much luck with a duck.<br/>I think you''ve done better.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve never had much luck with a duck.I think you''ve done better.Good luck!', '2006-07-07 15:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597858, 355927, 61679, '<td valign="top">and blurry.  Is this handheld or wasn''t your tripod sturdy enough?</td>', 'and blurry.  Is this handheld or wasn''t your tripod sturdy enough?', '2006-07-07 15:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597862, 356042, 23294, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors.  Definately gets the challenge across.</td>', 'Amazing colors.  Definately gets the challenge across.', '2006-07-07 15:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597866, 354802, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not stationary but gliding.</td>', 'Not stationary but gliding.', '2006-07-07 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597869, 356706, 23294, '<td valign="top">nice image here.  Another stationary being moved by the non-stationary photo.  Great choice for the time of exposure.</td>', 'nice image here.  Another stationary being moved by the non-stationary photo.  Great choice for the time of exposure.', '2006-07-07 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597872, 358096, 23294, '<td valign="top">I like this, nice job.</td>', 'I like this, nice job.', '2006-07-07 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597873, 358519, 39598, '<td valign="top">Very nice!<br/>Did you try this picture in the evening or early morning too?<br/>In full colour with enhanced contrast I think it could be quite an eye catcher.<br/>*10*</td>', 'Very nice!Did you try this picture in the evening or early morning too?In full colour with enhanced contrast I think it could be quite an eye catcher.*10*', '2006-07-07 15:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597876, 358692, 61679, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like he really wants to move. Love the tone of this image but the person at the bottom left really hurts the overall effect.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like he really wants to move. Love the tone of this image but the person at the bottom left really hurts the overall effect.', '2006-07-07 15:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597880, 358097, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not a great macro shot and the subject is weak for this challenge.</td>', 'Not a great macro shot and the subject is weak for this challenge.', '2006-07-07 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597881, 355873, 23294, '<td valign="top">it really does look like it doesn''t it!</td>', 'it really does look like it doesn''t it!', '2006-07-07 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597885, 355917, 61679, '<td valign="top">Looks very posed and the clothing style doesn''t fit the sepia tone. 4</td>', 'Looks very posed and the clothing style doesn''t fit the sepia tone. 4', '2006-07-07 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597890, 357796, 61679, '<td valign="top">Poor image quality.  Lacks a focal point and is very dark.</td>', 'Poor image quality.  Lacks a focal point and is very dark.', '2006-07-07 15:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597893, 354929, 23294, '<td valign="top">nice composition, and the color processing is very pleasing.</td>', 'nice composition, and the color processing is very pleasing.', '2006-07-07 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597898, 354888, 39598, '<td valign="top">The midtones in this shot came out nicely.<br/>I might have cropped in a bit tighter to the ship and filled more of the shot with it.</td>', 'The midtones in this shot came out nicely.I might have cropped in a bit tighter to the ship and filled more of the shot with it.', '2006-07-07 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597957, 356165, 39598, '<td valign="top">I think this rates under the category of happy snap.<br/>It could do with a great deal more attention to composition, to perspective and to lighting.<br/>What is the image trying to say?<br/>What should the viewer be coming away with?<br/>How best could the image be composed to achieve this with punch?<br/>Ask yourself those questions and have another go.<br/>You''ll notice a dramatic improvement. I promise.<br/>Better luck next time.</td>', 'I think this rates under the category of happy snap.It could do with a great deal more attention to composition, to perspective and to lighting.What is the image trying to say?What should the viewer be coming away with?How best could the image be composed to achieve this with punch?Ask yourself those questions and have another go.You''ll notice a dramatic improvement. I promise.Better luck next time.', '2006-07-07 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597974, 358366, 39598, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know where this photo is going to.<br/>Maybe you could have zoomed into the cross, right on top of the steeple and then silhouetted it in the setting sun.<br/>Maybe you could have gotten closer to the steeple and shot from directly below, at street level, making it seem even more grandiose against the blue sky.<br/>This reminds me of a casual shot taken through the window of a tour bus, and lacks all of the punch which makes a good shot great.</td>', 'I don''t really know where this photo is going to.Maybe you could have zoomed into the cross, right on top of the steeple and then silhouetted it in the setting sun.Maybe you could have gotten closer to the steeple and shot from directly below, at street level, making it seem even more grandiose against the blue sky.This reminds me of a casual shot taken through the window of a tour bus, and lacks all of the punch which makes a good shot great.', '2006-07-07 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597985, 358241, 39598, '<td valign="top">That''s a double negative you nana!</td>', 'That''s a double negative you nana!', '2006-07-07 16:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597997, 357814, 39598, '<td valign="top">Fireworks in black and white.<br/>Interesting concept.<br/>Pity is was a single burst, relegated to a corner of the shot, and subjected to a crop.</td>', 'Fireworks in black and white.Interesting concept.Pity is was a single burst, relegated to a corner of the shot, and subjected to a crop.', '2006-07-07 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598028, 358532, 39598, '<td valign="top">The kids were like: "My eyes can''t take it anymore!!!"<br/>And you''re like "Shut up! And stop moving!"<br/>I like it!<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'The kids were like: "My eyes can''t take it anymore!!!"And you''re like "Shut up! And stop moving!"I like it!Good luck.', '2006-07-07 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598035, 354992, 39598, '<td valign="top">I don''t follow.<br/>Why upside down?<br/>And why the piece of the hand and the piece of the head?<br/>Maybe it''s a physics thing, and I don''t get it...</td>', 'I don''t follow.Why upside down?And why the piece of the hand and the piece of the head?Maybe it''s a physics thing, and I don''t get it...', '2006-07-07 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598044, 358296, 39598, '<td valign="top">You must be a pom to be calling this a WC.<br/>No offense mate.<br/>Just a fact.<br/>Nice shot.<br/>What was the ocassion?</td>', 'You must be a pom to be calling this a WC.No offense mate.Just a fact.Nice shot.What was the ocassion?', '2006-07-07 16:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598053, 357538, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much.<br/>Awesome work.</td>', 'I like this shot very much.Awesome work.', '2006-07-07 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598078, 358518, 39598, '<td valign="top">Ever ready to voice an opinion he leaps in and with a single bound states:<br/>"I would have liked the tree to have been isolated and all on its own. But nature doesn''t always play our game. Good luck anyway."</td>', 'Ever ready to voice an opinion he leaps in and with a single bound states:"I would have liked the tree to have been isolated and all on its own. But nature doesn''t always play our game. Good luck anyway."', '2006-07-07 16:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598083, 358075, 39598, '<td valign="top">Catchy caption, but I do get the feeling it could do with more contrast and colour correction.<br/>Just to add some pizzaz, you know?</td>', 'Catchy caption, but I do get the feeling it could do with more contrast and colour correction.Just to add some pizzaz, you know?', '2006-07-07 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598093, 355889, 39598, '<td valign="top">This picture has been hugely over-sharpened.<br/>Methinks it would have benefitted from being softer, rather than being made more harsh, especially with all of the fine detail it already contains.<br/>But that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'This picture has been hugely over-sharpened.Methinks it would have benefitted from being softer, rather than being made more harsh, especially with all of the fine detail it already contains.But that''s just my opinion.', '2006-07-07 16:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598096, 358677, 39598, '<td valign="top">Is that actually an empty water bottle lying on the table?<br/>Why was it left there?</td>', 'Is that actually an empty water bottle lying on the table?Why was it left there?', '2006-07-07 16:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598114, 355434, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots which have benefitted from some fill-flash.<br/>It''s lacking in detail for me.<br/>Otherwise it is very nicely composed, with a great choice of angle to get in and get the shot.<br/>You''ve clearly thought about what you wanted your viewer to see.<br/>I like it.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of those shots which have benefitted from some fill-flash.It''s lacking in detail for me.Otherwise it is very nicely composed, with a great choice of angle to get in and get the shot.You''ve clearly thought about what you wanted your viewer to see.I like it.Good luck!', '2006-07-07 16:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598136, 358226, 39598, '<td valign="top">It''s a tree, right?<br/>A bit of a blurry tree.</td>', 'It''s a tree, right?A bit of a blurry tree.', '2006-07-07 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598145, 355421, 39598, '<td valign="top">I love it!<br/>The only comments I have are regarding the depth of the colour and the sharpness of the image. With some attention to those details, this great shot could have become FANTASTIC.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I love it!The only comments I have are regarding the depth of the colour and the sharpness of the image. With some attention to those details, this great shot could have become FANTASTIC.Good luck!', '2006-07-07 17:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598150, 354917, 39598, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing which really jumps out at me in this shot.</td>', 'There''s nothing which really jumps out at me in this shot.', '2006-07-07 17:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598156, 356700, 39598, '<td valign="top">Early morning or late afternoon would have been a better time to take a shot of this boat, and closer up too, with a long angle down the side, towards the shore or the sea.<br/>I don''t know.<br/>In mid-day sun, directly overhead, with no polarising filter, this shot lacks punch.<br/>But keep at it.</td>', 'Early morning or late afternoon would have been a better time to take a shot of this boat, and closer up too, with a long angle down the side, towards the shore or the sea.I don''t know.In mid-day sun, directly overhead, with no polarising filter, this shot lacks punch.But keep at it.', '2006-07-07 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598160, 355687, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, with nice lighting.<br/>Does the building in the background get lit up with a bluish light at night?<br/>A nice night-shot, (if that is the case) would be good too, and would probably lift the horses even more, adding greater drama.</td>', 'Nice shot, with nice lighting.Does the building in the background get lit up with a bluish light at night?A nice night-shot, (if that is the case) would be good too, and would probably lift the horses even more, adding greater drama.', '2006-07-07 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598162, 358108, 39598, '<td valign="top">Hey man!<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'Hey man!Nice shot!', '2006-07-07 17:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
