(2598266, 357055, 35334, '<td valign="top">Yes, I get it. You are showing the exact opposite of stationary and making the point that still photography makes everything stationary. But <b>every</b> still photograph makes this point so I gave it a 1.<br/> <br/>Now I have come back and looked at it again. It really is a striking image of motorcycles in motion and it does make the point about still photography very well. I''ve changed my vote to an 8.<br/> <br/>I just wish you could have moved the pink tire. It really is stationary.</td>', 'Yes, I get it. You are showing the exact opposite of stationary and making the point that still photography makes everything stationary. But every still photograph makes this point so I gave it a 1. Now I have come back and looked at it again. It really is a striking image of motorcycles in motion and it does make the point about still photography very well. I''ve changed my vote to an 8. I just wish you could have moved the pink tire. It really is stationary.', '2006-07-07 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
