(2600027, 356165, 61679, '<td valign="top">What is it?  The image has no real focal point that captures the eye. The exposure looks about right for such a mixture of sun and shade. 4</td>', 'What is it?  The image has no real focal point that captures the eye. The exposure looks about right for such a mixture of sun and shade. 4', '2006-07-08 08:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600050, 358401, 61679, '<td valign="top">Although the face does communicate somewhat the frustration that could be felt because the stroller isn''t moving, is also could also be saying tired, hungry, or what''s this stranger doing with that camera.  A sleeping toddler would have been a stronger stationary challenge subject.  On the technical side, the eyes should be the sharpest area in the photo instead of the back edge of the stroller.</td>', 'Although the face does communicate somewhat the frustration that could be felt because the stroller isn''t moving, is also could also be saying tired, hungry, or what''s this stranger doing with that camera.  A sleeping toddler would have been a stronger stationary challenge subject.  On the technical side, the eyes should be the sharpest area in the photo instead of the back edge of the stroller.', '2006-07-08 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600057, 358564, 61679, '<td valign="top">There are too many things that draw my eyes away from the main subject, the trees.  Things like the pathway and the animal/statue in the background.  Part of that is due to the lighting and part to the uniform color of the trees.  If you cropped off the left half of the picture and converted this to black and white with high contrast, the light that is actually on the top of the tree limbs would become the focal point and allow the trees to become the main subject.</td>', 'There are too many things that draw my eyes away from the main subject, the trees.  Things like the pathway and the animal/statue in the background.  Part of that is due to the lighting and part to the uniform color of the trees.  If you cropped off the left half of the picture and converted this to black and white with high contrast, the light that is actually on the top of the tree limbs would become the focal point and allow the trees to become the main subject.', '2006-07-08 08:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600098, 357987, 31133, '<td valign="top">Good colors. The thing with this image is that my eye keeps going to the only really sharp and bright part just left of center. And then it''s hard for me to figure out what it is since there''s not much detail in that part. Your title helps me understand that these are fossils. I think the dof is good but possible not on the right area within the image. The fossil to the left looks really interesting thanks to its spiral form.</td>', 'Good colors. The thing with this image is that my eye keeps going to the only really sharp and bright part just left of center. And then it''s hard for me to figure out what it is since there''s not much detail in that part. Your title helps me understand that these are fossils. I think the dof is good but possible not on the right area within the image. The fossil to the left looks really interesting thanks to its spiral form.', '2006-07-08 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600103, 356700, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a little too dead center for it to be very interesting to me. I don''t really understand the title either, but I try not to let titles affect me scoring in any negative way. I think this is an interesting subject, even if the presentation doesn''t do a lot for me ... a detail crop to emphasize the hull or just the cabin would be awesome! Nice colors in the sand and sky.</td>', 'This is a little too dead center for it to be very interesting to me. I don''t really understand the title either, but I try not to let titles affect me scoring in any negative way. I think this is an interesting subject, even if the presentation doesn''t do a lot for me ... a detail crop to emphasize the hull or just the cabin would be awesome! Nice colors in the sand and sky.', '2006-07-08 09:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600105, 356263, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Face is a little blurry, but so cute!</td>', 'Nice composition. Face is a little blurry, but so cute!', '2006-07-08 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600107, 358693, 31133, '<td valign="top">Composition is really nice! I thnk the highlights and loss of contrast in the shadows hurts quite a bit, though. Might be a bit too dark for many monitors as well. It''s a cute face framed by that wood. I don''t mark down for titles at all, but would like to mention that it''s not recommended to describe your technicals in a title.</td>', 'Composition is really nice! I thnk the highlights and loss of contrast in the shadows hurts quite a bit, though. Might be a bit too dark for many monitors as well. It''s a cute face framed by that wood. I don''t mark down for titles at all, but would like to mention that it''s not recommended to describe your technicals in a title.', '2006-07-08 09:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600119, 358629, 48228, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.....A "10" from me.....</td>', 'Breathtaking.....A "10" from me.....', '2006-07-08 09:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600234, 356838, 61679, '<td valign="top">This competition is steep in this challenge and I suspect it will pull your score down just a bit.  I like the use of the red light to convey stationary, as it is the universal signal for stop.  The 24 sign is a bit too prominent in this image for my tastes and really doesn''t add to the challenge subject.  The exposure is well done the background color is nicely saturated.</td>', 'This competition is steep in this challenge and I suspect it will pull your score down just a bit.  I like the use of the red light to convey stationary, as it is the universal signal for stop.  The 24 sign is a bit too prominent in this image for my tastes and really doesn''t add to the challenge subject.  The exposure is well done the background color is nicely saturated.', '2006-07-08 10:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600239, 358460, 61679, '<td valign="top">Yes a statue is stationary and the exposure is exceptional; however, the sign in the background takes away any feeling this image conveys about being stationary.  The flow of the lines on the sign indicates places you can go and thus, motion.</td>', 'Yes a statue is stationary and the exposure is exceptional; however, the sign in the background takes away any feeling this image conveys about being stationary.  The flow of the lines on the sign indicates places you can go and thus, motion.', '2006-07-08 10:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600240, 356700, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great subject but soft on the focus. 5</td>', 'Great subject but soft on the focus. 5', '2006-07-08 10:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600241, 357814, 61679, '<td valign="top">No, fireworks.  Stop action via photography does not convey stationary very effectively.  Fireworks are constantly changing. 4</td>', 'No, fireworks.  Stop action via photography does not convey stationary very effectively.  Fireworks are constantly changing. 4', '2006-07-08 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600244, 358092, 61679, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the post processing.  The leaves on the ground foliage makes the vehicle look like it is in motion. 5</td>', 'I don''t care for the post processing.  The leaves on the ground foliage makes the vehicle look like it is in motion. 5', '2006-07-08 10:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600245, 358313, 61679, '<td valign="top">Need to be rotated to the left a couple of degrees. 5</td>', 'Need to be rotated to the left a couple of degrees. 5', '2006-07-08 10:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600246, 357649, 61679, '<td valign="top">The left side of the image serves little purpose and causes the main subject to be centered. 5</td>', 'The left side of the image serves little purpose and causes the main subject to be centered. 5', '2006-07-08 10:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600247, 357489, 61679, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation makes the color of the bridge look un-natural. 5</td>', 'The selective desaturation makes the color of the bridge look un-natural. 5', '2006-07-08 10:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600254, 358641, 61679, '<td valign="top">Bump to a 6 on my revisit.  The dog is definitly pointing at something and has frozen dead still.  If the focus was on the front portion of the dog with shallower depth of field, it would help the dog become the main focus point of the image instead a co-subject with the girl.</td>', 'Bump to a 6 on my revisit.  The dog is definitly pointing at something and has frozen dead still.  If the focus was on the front portion of the dog with shallower depth of field, it would help the dog become the main focus point of the image instead a co-subject with the girl.', '2006-07-08 10:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600300, 355933, 57462, '<td valign="top">I really like the  concept of this photograph.  I would have perhaps enjoyed a little more contrast though. 7</td>', 'I really like the  concept of this photograph.  I would have perhaps enjoyed a little more contrast though. 7', '2006-07-08 11:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600303, 356821, 57462, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the trike.  Prehaps the "old" feeling could be stronger if it was more towards black and white.  The magenta/purplish color is a little strong for me. 7</td>', 'I like the concept of the trike.  Prehaps the "old" feeling could be stronger if it was more towards black and white.  The magenta/purplish color is a little strong for me. 7', '2006-07-08 11:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600305, 358406, 57462, '<td valign="top">I love seeing these people.  They really are good at being stationary!  I wish the ladies head wasn''t at the bottom. 7</td>', 'I love seeing these people.  They really are good at being stationary!  I wish the ladies head wasn''t at the bottom. 7', '2006-07-08 11:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600306, 355048, 57462, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I not sure for me it says staionary.  But it is a great picture!</td>', 'I love this picture.  I not sure for me it says staionary.  But it is a great picture!', '2006-07-08 11:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
