(2600403, 354802, 60047, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - but it doesn''t say "stationary" to me.</td>', 'Excellent capture - but it doesn''t say "stationary" to me.', '2006-07-08 12:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600404, 357441, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a shot.</td>', 'Wow, what a shot.', '2006-07-08 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600406, 358532, 60047, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a more subdued expression from the girls. Nice idea for a shot.</td>', 'I would have liked a more subdued expression from the girls. Nice idea for a shot.', '2006-07-08 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600410, 358566, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the B &amp; W.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the B & W.', '2006-07-08 12:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600412, 357504, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2006-07-08 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600414, 355690, 60047, '<td valign="top">I get movement from this shot.</td>', 'I get movement from this shot.', '2006-07-08 12:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600417, 356907, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect (red vs b &amp; w).</td>', 'Interesting effect (red vs b & w).', '2006-07-08 12:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600419, 358685, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the saturation of the green and the placement of the transition between the water and the land.  The pipe isn''t the most attractive thing for the bird to be resting on and the out streach of the wings conveys less about stationary than if the bird were completely at rest.  It''s also a pity that the bird isn''t in profile.  All in all the image is of good quality but the positioning of the bird and its selection of a perch work against you.</td>', 'I like the saturation of the green and the placement of the transition between the water and the land.  The pipe isn''t the most attractive thing for the bird to be resting on and the out streach of the wings conveys less about stationary than if the bird were completely at rest.  It''s also a pity that the bird isn''t in profile.  All in all the image is of good quality but the positioning of the bird and its selection of a perch work against you.', '2006-07-08 12:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600420, 357634, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image has no truely distinctive features and requires some help via post processing. 5</td>', 'This image has no truely distinctive features and requires some help via post processing. 5', '2006-07-08 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600422, 358426, 61679, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice enough image but it says momentary pause more than stationary.  This image could have a much bigger impact if you could have used advanced editing. 5</td>', 'It''s a nice enough image but it says momentary pause more than stationary.  This image could have a much bigger impact if you could have used advanced editing. 5', '2006-07-08 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600423, 357269, 61679, '<td valign="top">The strong lighting is fighting the soft focus.  5</td>', 'The strong lighting is fighting the soft focus.  5', '2006-07-08 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600424, 355537, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great shot - though I don''t get "stationary" from it.</td>', 'Great shot - though I don''t get "stationary" from it.', '2006-07-08 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2600427, 356078, 60047, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the entire box to be in focus</td>', 'I would have liked the entire box to be in focus', '2006-07-08 12:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
