(2602563, 358579, 55838, '<td valign="top">Although roadkill would not be my first choice for this challenge - somehow your pic is oddly pleasing.  I think because the animal is not shot in a gorey way and the eye tends to go to the bike.  I think waiting a split second to capture the bike so that he was independednt of the kill would have enhanced this shot.</td>', 'Although roadkill would not be my first choice for this challenge - somehow your pic is oddly pleasing.  I think because the animal is not shot in a gorey way and the eye tends to go to the bike.  I think waiting a split second to capture the bike so that he was independednt of the kill would have enhanced this shot.', '2006-07-09 06:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
