(2602572, 358398, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to bump.  Great feeling of stationary against the movement of the train.  The colors are nice - train shots are often B&amp;W but the color really enhances this one. 8</td>', 'Back to bump.  Great feeling of stationary against the movement of the train.  The colors are nice - train shots are often B&W but the color really enhances this one. 8', '2006-07-09 07:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602573, 356314, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to bump.  This is my favorite for the challenge.  Beautifully stationary.  Lovely darkness against the very cool looking water. 9</td>', 'Back to bump.  This is my favorite for the challenge.  Beautifully stationary.  Lovely darkness against the very cool looking water. 9', '2006-07-09 07:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602604, 357973, 61679, '<td valign="top">The first time I looked at this image I knew it wasn''t a strong subject choice for this challenge but I couldn''t figure out why.  Now that I am revisiting to comment, I can tell you why it doesn''t work for me.  First, the sign is an information sign telling you to be careful and maybe even slow down.  Second, nothing about the sign and surroundings say you need to stop or that the person already is stopped and is just starting back up. Since the sign is the main subject of this image it needs to sell the challenge theme and it really doesn''t do that very well.</td>', 'The first time I looked at this image I knew it wasn''t a strong subject choice for this challenge but I couldn''t figure out why.  Now that I am revisiting to comment, I can tell you why it doesn''t work for me.  First, the sign is an information sign telling you to be careful and maybe even slow down.  Second, nothing about the sign and surroundings say you need to stop or that the person already is stopped and is just starting back up. Since the sign is the main subject of this image it needs to sell the challenge theme and it really doesn''t do that very well.', '2006-07-09 07:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602605, 354802, 52074, '<td valign="top">Great capture here, however, I''m sure I''m not the first to mention that this is not stationary.</td>', 'Great capture here, however, I''m sure I''m not the first to mention that this is not stationary.', '2006-07-09 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602608, 358069, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think you picked a very good subject for this challenge.  There primary issue keeping this image from scoring higher is that the main subject isn''t tack sharp.  The soft focue in the face area actually convey the feeling of motion instead of froozen in time.  I''m sure others will find fault as well with the harsh lighting but since he is wearing sun glasses and there is still lots of detail in his face, I think the lighting is quite effective.</td>', 'I think you picked a very good subject for this challenge.  There primary issue keeping this image from scoring higher is that the main subject isn''t tack sharp.  The soft focue in the face area actually convey the feeling of motion instead of froozen in time.  I''m sure others will find fault as well with the harsh lighting but since he is wearing sun glasses and there is still lots of detail in his face, I think the lighting is quite effective.', '2006-07-09 07:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602609, 358419, 52074, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo here. Calming, wonderfully framed people in the boat.</td>', 'Very nice photo here. Calming, wonderfully framed people in the boat.', '2006-07-09 07:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602613, 355889, 61679, '<td valign="top">The soft focus of this image suggest that there might be some camera shake involved.  Compositionally, I have a couple of suggestions you might try.  First, I would have liked to have seen the all of the red boat in the picture.  The color of the red boat complements the colors of the blue boat; however it should be part of the story instead of just looking like something stuck in the background.  Second, if you would have moved to the left to get more of the beach and water into the image, it would have better supported your title Low Tide.  As it is, I almost missed the water in the far right corner, thus the boat looked like it was being stored.</td>', 'The soft focus of this image suggest that there might be some camera shake involved.  Compositionally, I have a couple of suggestions you might try.  First, I would have liked to have seen the all of the red boat in the picture.  The color of the red boat complements the colors of the blue boat; however it should be part of the story instead of just looking like something stuck in the background.  Second, if you would have moved to the left to get more of the beach and water into the image, it would have better supported your title Low Tide.  As it is, I almost missed the water in the far right corner, thus the boat looked like it was being stored.', '2006-07-09 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602614, 356042, 52074, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Reflection and rays of the sun pull everything together for me here.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Reflection and rays of the sun pull everything together for me here.', '2006-07-09 07:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602615, 358137, 52074, '<td valign="top">WOW!!  Another poster for my wall!! :O)  Great color, depth and composition. Bumping. Love this photo.!!</td>', 'WOW!!  Another poster for my wall!! :O)  Great color, depth and composition. Bumping. Love this photo.!!', '2006-07-09 07:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602617, 358325, 52074, '<td valign="top">A fav. Nice color tones, perfect time of day to capture this. Good job. Bumping</td>', 'A fav. Nice color tones, perfect time of day to capture this. Good job. Bumping', '2006-07-09 07:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602618, 358075, 61679, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I really don''t know what this object is.  The fact that it looks like it was designed to be stationary doesn''t make it a very strong subject for a stationary challenge.  The technical aspects of the image appear to be pretty good; however, the composition of the image and placing of the object makes it look like the mondane, everyday object it is.</td>', 'To be honest, I really don''t know what this object is.  The fact that it looks like it was designed to be stationary doesn''t make it a very strong subject for a stationary challenge.  The technical aspects of the image appear to be pretty good; however, the composition of the image and placing of the object makes it look like the mondane, everyday object it is.', '2006-07-09 07:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602625, 358293, 61679, '<td valign="top">The soft focus of this image suggest that you may be experiencing a little bit of camera shake or that you need to sharpen the image after reducing the size.  I like the subject matter of this image and the title even made me smile, as it is a play on words for the recent US holiday, Independance Day.  The lighting makes it hard to see detail in the eagle but this could be improved using levels or curves.  I also suggest that you might want to use a square crop, removing as much of the right side of the image as possible to reduce the negative space.  My eyes want to look in the direction that the eagle is looking; however the negative space and the slant of the tree brach draw my eyes to the right side of the image.</td>', 'The soft focus of this image suggest that you may be experiencing a little bit of camera shake or that you need to sharpen the image after reducing the size.  I like the subject matter of this image and the title even made me smile, as it is a play on words for the recent US holiday, Independance Day.  The lighting makes it hard to see detail in the eagle but this could be improved using levels or curves.  I also suggest that you might want to use a square crop, removing as much of the right side of the image as possible to reduce the negative space.  My eyes want to look in the direction that the eagle is looking; however the negative space and the slant of the tree brach draw my eyes to the right side of the image.', '2006-07-09 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602626, 358574, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely photo and the lighting and focus are spot on.  However a statue is always stationary, which weakens this entry for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a very lovely photo and the lighting and focus are spot on.  However a statue is always stationary, which weakens this entry for this challenge.', '2006-07-09 08:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602627, 358289, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the B&amp;W conversion of this image very much.  The background is kind of busy and actually blends into the left shoulder of the statue.  Although the statue itself protrays something that does move, statues in themselves are stationary objects and aren''t the stronges subject choice for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the B&W conversion of this image very much.  The background is kind of busy and actually blends into the left shoulder of the statue.  Although the statue itself protrays something that does move, statues in themselves are stationary objects and aren''t the stronges subject choice for this challenge.', '2006-07-09 08:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602629, 358363, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely scene but it really doesn''t convey stationary very well, as the lights give the feeling that they are open for business and trains could be coming and going.  Although the Station part of Railway Station is a fun play on the Stationary theme, I would never have known this was a rail station without the title.  On the techical side, the lights along the left side of the building are a little blown.  This would indicate that the exposure time was a little long.  There also appears to be a little camera shake involved, as the building does not have a stong focus to it.</td>', 'This is a very lovely scene but it really doesn''t convey stationary very well, as the lights give the feeling that they are open for business and trains could be coming and going.  Although the Station part of Railway Station is a fun play on the Stationary theme, I would never have known this was a rail station without the title.  On the techical side, the lights along the left side of the building are a little blown.  This would indicate that the exposure time was a little long.  There also appears to be a little camera shake involved, as the building does not have a stong focus to it.', '2006-07-09 08:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602633, 357762, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the subject you choose for this challenge very much.  I have a few suggestions you might want to try to improve the strenth of the composition and the overall quality of the image.  First, you may want to remove the boats on the right hand edge and some of the sky by cropping.  The direction of the boats tends to lead my eyes out of the picture and away from the stonger positioned boats.  The top of the sky has very little detail and removing would make the relationship between the dry docked boats and the water stronger.  Second, the waterline and dock make this image appear slanted to the right.  A slight rotation to the left to bring these features horizontal would help the visual impact.  Third, the colors in the sky are a bit washed out.  I think these could be improved using saturation, curves, and levels in post processing.</td>', 'I like the subject you choose for this challenge very much.  I have a few suggestions you might want to try to improve the strenth of the composition and the overall quality of the image.  First, you may want to remove the boats on the right hand edge and some of the sky by cropping.  The direction of the boats tends to lead my eyes out of the picture and away from the stonger positioned boats.  The top of the sky has very little detail and removing would make the relationship between the dry docked boats and the water stronger.  Second, the waterline and dock make this image appear slanted to the right.  A slight rotation to the left to bring these features horizontal would help the visual impact.  Third, the colors in the sky are a bit washed out.  I think these could be improved using saturation, curves, and levels in post processing.', '2006-07-09 08:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602637, 358675, 61679, '<td valign="top">To me the subject matter doesn''t look like he is resting but in the process of getting started.  The rider''s right foot is under the pedal, trying to bring it forward so he can get started again, instead of on top in the rest position.  Second, the focal point needs to be on the rider''s eyes.  As presented, the handlebars are in sharper focus than the face of the rider.</td>', 'To me the subject matter doesn''t look like he is resting but in the process of getting started.  The rider''s right foot is under the pedal, trying to bring it forward so he can get started again, instead of on top in the rest position.  Second, the focal point needs to be on the rider''s eyes.  As presented, the handlebars are in sharper focus than the face of the rider.', '2006-07-09 08:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602705, 358196, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent.....I hope this one does well.....A "10" from me.....</td>', 'Excellent.....I hope this one does well.....A "10" from me.....', '2006-07-09 09:32:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2602709, 355925, 48228, '<td valign="top">Another great image here.....</td>', 'Another great image here.....', '2006-07-09 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602712, 358138, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.<br/>Has "2 fast for another dumb sequel" written all over it!<br/>erm...</td>', 'I like this shot.Has "2 fast for another dumb sequel" written all over it!erm...', '2006-07-09 09:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602714, 357643, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice pic - sadly suffering from over-processing.</td>', 'Nice pic - sadly suffering from over-processing.', '2006-07-09 09:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602718, 357759, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.<br/>Nice crop.</td>', 'I like this a lot.Nice crop.', '2006-07-09 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602720, 358577, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.<br/>WOW colours!</td>', 'Nice pic.WOW colours!', '2006-07-09 09:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602729, 358606, 39598, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or is there something fuzzy about this photo?<br/>Like it''s not completely in focus, or suffered from a slight motion blur as you shot it?<br/>Would have looked better if sharper focused (and I don''t mean post process).<br/>Good luck anyway!</td>', 'Is it just me or is there something fuzzy about this photo?Like it''s not completely in focus, or suffered from a slight motion blur as you shot it?Would have looked better if sharper focused (and I don''t mean post process).Good luck anyway!', '2006-07-09 09:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602731, 358582, 39598, '<td valign="top">Don''t let Kent Hovind hear you say that...<br/>(I''m a creationist myself)</td>', 'Don''t let Kent Hovind hear you say that...(I''m a creationist myself)', '2006-07-09 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602736, 358613, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.....</td>', 'I really like this one.....', '2006-07-09 09:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602737, 355048, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!<br/>And that teeny weeny little sparkle on the frog''s (chin?) is really cool.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice shot!And that teeny weeny little sparkle on the frog''s (chin?) is really cool.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 09:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602740, 358481, 39598, '<td valign="top">Some more contrast might have helped, methinks.</td>', 'Some more contrast might have helped, methinks.', '2006-07-09 09:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602744, 358579, 39598, '<td valign="top">You''ve composed this shot nicely to avoid being overly graphic with it, while saying exactly what needed to be said. The cyclist is a really nice touch.</td>', 'You''ve composed this shot nicely to avoid being overly graphic with it, while saying exactly what needed to be said. The cyclist is a really nice touch.', '2006-07-09 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602748, 358372, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and nice colours.<br/>Did the dog come with the floor, or the floor with the dog?<br/>mmmm.<br/>Could maybe have enjoyed more depth in colouring.<br/>But otherwise a good entry.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition and nice colours.Did the dog come with the floor, or the floor with the dog?mmmm.Could maybe have enjoyed more depth in colouring.But otherwise a good entry.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 10:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602750, 356171, 39598, '<td valign="top">Wrong time of day for the shot if you ask me.<br/>Early morning or late afternoon would have been better.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Wrong time of day for the shot if you ask me.Early morning or late afternoon would have been better.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602759, 357634, 39598, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Pretty picture.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 10:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602760, 356236, 39598, '<td valign="top">Is that fluff on the lens?</td>', 'Is that fluff on the lens?', '2006-07-09 10:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602768, 358398, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT shot!<br/>Probably the best of the lot.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This is a GREAT shot!Probably the best of the lot.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 10:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602769, 355537, 39598, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening.</td>', 'Too much sharpening.', '2006-07-09 10:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602772, 354973, 39598, '<td valign="top">Impressive capture!</td>', 'Impressive capture!', '2006-07-09 10:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602774, 357085, 39598, '<td valign="top">This photo suffers from poor attention to composition.</td>', 'This photo suffers from poor attention to composition.', '2006-07-09 10:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602787, 357502, 39598, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m supposed to be looking at.<br/>You need to direct my attention to something.<br/>Something specific which tells me that you''ve thought about the shot you ended up taking.<br/>And then taken the trouble to take it.<br/>Like lying down in the grass, choosing one flower, and then silhouetting it against the blue sky, maybe even with the sun shining closely behind it.<br/>Your caption says "lying in grass"<br/>What is it that is lying in the grass?<br/>I can''t see it.<br/>I hope you find all of this helpful.<br/>Good luck next time!</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m supposed to be looking at.You need to direct my attention to something.Something specific which tells me that you''ve thought about the shot you ended up taking.And then taken the trouble to take it.Like lying down in the grass, choosing one flower, and then silhouetting it against the blue sky, maybe even with the sun shining closely behind it.Your caption says "lying in grass"What is it that is lying in the grass?I can''t see it.I hope you find all of this helpful.Good luck next time!', '2006-07-09 10:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602791, 356504, 39598, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2006-07-09 10:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602793, 356433, 39598, '<td valign="top">Hope you swatted the damn thing!<br/>Nice photo!</td>', 'Hope you swatted the damn thing!Nice photo!', '2006-07-09 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602795, 357350, 39598, '<td valign="top">Perfect time for skiing!</td>', 'Perfect time for skiing!', '2006-07-09 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602799, 354819, 39598, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit flat for my liking, and you''ve compressed it so badly that the "jaggies" ruin it even further. Try to get the file size as close to what DP will allow, rather than trying to get it as small as possible.<br/>That will solve the second problem.<br/>The first is a matter of curves and levels.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'The photo is a bit flat for my liking, and you''ve compressed it so badly that the "jaggies" ruin it even further. Try to get the file size as close to what DP will allow, rather than trying to get it as small as possible.That will solve the second problem.The first is a matter of curves and levels.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602803, 355873, 39598, '<td valign="top">Shucks.<br/>Methinks this photo would have been better held back for this week''s challenge.</td>', 'Shucks.Methinks this photo would have been better held back for this week''s challenge.', '2006-07-09 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602810, 356859, 39598, '<td valign="top">What a funny looking creature!</td>', 'What a funny looking creature!', '2006-07-09 10:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602811, 358629, 39598, '<td valign="top">It feels slightly off-kilter to me.</td>', 'It feels slightly off-kilter to me.', '2006-07-09 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602813, 355690, 39598, '<td valign="top">I lurrrv those clouds!</td>', 'I lurrrv those clouds!', '2006-07-09 10:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602814, 358395, 39598, '<td valign="top">No it doesn''t!</td>', 'No it doesn''t!', '2006-07-09 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602816, 358378, 39598, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the composition which puts me off this photo.<br/>Like it''s just TOO straight on, know what I mean?</td>', 'There''s something about the composition which puts me off this photo.Like it''s just TOO straight on, know what I mean?', '2006-07-09 10:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602820, 358376, 39598, '<td valign="top">That''s "...IN the midst of others"</td>', 'That''s "...IN the midst of others"', '2006-07-09 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602835, 357443, 39598, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit overly sharpened, but has great composition!<br/>The colours are great, and I like the dark fall-off in the distance.<br/>This is a great example of the fact that you don''t need to take a photo of the WHOLE boat (dingy / canoe / Titanic / whatever) to prove to the viewer that they''re looking at a boat.<br/>Hope to see you in the top photos!<br/>(The sharpening got you a 9, sadly...)</td>', 'Looks a bit overly sharpened, but has great composition!The colours are great, and I like the dark fall-off in the distance.This is a great example of the fact that you don''t need to take a photo of the WHOLE boat (dingy / canoe / Titanic / whatever) to prove to the viewer that they''re looking at a boat.Hope to see you in the top photos!(The sharpening got you a 9, sadly...)', '2006-07-09 11:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602841, 357453, 19507, '<td valign="top">The textured appearance of the grass gives a nice graphic impact to this shot.  Simple, but interesting.</td>', 'The textured appearance of the grass gives a nice graphic impact to this shot.  Simple, but interesting.', '2006-07-09 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602878, 357194, 57323, '<td valign="top">Was this taken on Cape Cod? I have photos of a similar scene with what looks like the same blue boat. Nice pic.</td>', 'Was this taken on Cape Cod? I have photos of a similar scene with what looks like the same blue boat. Nice pic.', '2006-07-09 11:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602913, 358601, 10134, '<td valign="top">concept is amazing, it ABSOLUTELY fits the challenge. Picture is ok but i would have done something for the CYAN sky, it''s too light and... cyan !</td>', 'concept is amazing, it ABSOLUTELY fits the challenge. Picture is ok but i would have done something for the CYAN sky, it''s too light and... cyan !', '2006-07-09 11:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602972, 354802, 118503, '<td valign="top">DNMC, DNMC, DNMC, DNMC...<br/> <br/>Please read the description.</td>', 'DNMC, DNMC, DNMC, DNMC... Please read the description.', '2006-07-09 12:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2602979, 358566, 42916, '<td valign="top">great idea, good use of equipment</td>', 'great idea, good use of equipment', '2006-07-09 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
