(2603058, 358666, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice colors.</td>', 'nice colors.', '2006-07-09 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603252, 356486, 33392, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this one.  The tones are great!<br/> <br/>Curious - how did you decide which challenge to enter this in?  It would''ve done well in either.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this one.  The tones are great! Curious - how did you decide which challenge to enter this in?  It would''ve done well in either.', '2006-07-09 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603253, 358629, 33392, '<td valign="top">Beautiful deep colors.  Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful deep colors.  Very nice.', '2006-07-09 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603255, 358419, 33392, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this one.  It''s a bit of a stretch to me to have this one in the challenge (the canoe is moving, and it, rather than the water, seems to be the subject), but I still gave it an 8.</td>', 'I love the colors in this one.  It''s a bit of a stretch to me to have this one in the challenge (the canoe is moving, and it, rather than the water, seems to be the subject), but I still gave it an 8.', '2006-07-09 14:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603261, 354802, 61179, '<td valign="top">A very lovely photo! It''s the opposite of stationary, though.</td>', 'A very lovely photo! It''s the opposite of stationary, though.', '2006-07-09 14:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603286, 358677, 30982, '<td valign="top">I know where this is...  Nice angles, nice shot without 100 people in it, too!</td>', 'I know where this is...  Nice angles, nice shot without 100 people in it, too!', '2006-07-09 15:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603288, 355431, 30982, '<td valign="top">Works very nicely in B&amp;W.  Well composed, great lighting.</td>', 'Works very nicely in B&W.  Well composed, great lighting.', '2006-07-09 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603293, 357987, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trilobite?</td>', 'Trilobite?', '2006-07-09 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603294, 358411, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good puppy picture.</td>', 'Very good puppy picture.', '2006-07-09 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603320, 356459, 60244, '<td valign="top">It takes time to digest this because of the colors. It is almost surreal. It''s beautiful.  7 from me</td>', 'It takes time to digest this because of the colors. It is almost surreal. It''s beautiful.  7 from me', '2006-07-09 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603350, 354929, 58247, '<td valign="top">I love the warm, relaxed feel of this photo. Very well done.</td>', 'I love the warm, relaxed feel of this photo. Very well done.', '2006-07-09 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603355, 358528, 48967, '<td valign="top">If only you wouldn''t used flash and a longer exposure time instead...<br/>Beautiful picture, but the flash... that''s no good!</td>', 'If only you wouldn''t used flash and a longer exposure time instead...Beautiful picture, but the flash... that''s no good!', '2006-07-09 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603357, 355537, 48967, '<td valign="top">Graet colors!</td>', 'Graet colors!', '2006-07-09 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603359, 358475, 48967, '<td valign="top">Great tones!!!! Sometimes rocks can be beautiful :)</td>', 'Great tones!!!! Sometimes rocks can be beautiful :)', '2006-07-09 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603361, 356433, 48967, '<td valign="top">Man that''s such a great macro!!! wonder how much time you waited for the fly to pose for you...</td>', 'Man that''s such a great macro!!! wonder how much time you waited for the fly to pose for you...', '2006-07-09 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603565, 357702, 61679, '<td valign="top">Stationary and emotionally moving at the same time.  Very effective. Bump to a ten.</td>', 'Stationary and emotionally moving at the same time.  Very effective. Bump to a ten.', '2006-07-09 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603567, 357441, 61679, '<td valign="top">What a moving image.  The passing people only help to make your title oh so true.  Bump to a ten.</td>', 'What a moving image.  The passing people only help to make your title oh so true.  Bump to a ten.', '2006-07-09 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603652, 356454, 39598, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going with this shot, and man, I wish you''d gotten there.<br/>Instead I think you''ve over-sharpened and then over-blurred it. (Not sure how, but anyway...) The grass is hopelessly over-sharpened, and all of the grey in the image is very blurred. Plus, the file was heavily compressed to cause all of those jpeg jaggies. Try to keep your images as close to the 150Kb limit as you possibly can.<br/>Better luck next time...</td>', 'I can see where you were going with this shot, and man, I wish you''d gotten there.Instead I think you''ve over-sharpened and then over-blurred it. (Not sure how, but anyway...) The grass is hopelessly over-sharpened, and all of the grey in the image is very blurred. Plus, the file was heavily compressed to cause all of those jpeg jaggies. Try to keep your images as close to the 150Kb limit as you possibly can.Better luck next time...', '2006-07-09 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603662, 356314, 39598, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture!<br/>You''ve gotten the technical and the abstract issues all working together nicely in order to ensure a great image. I''m convinced. *10*<br/> <br/>Do you ever get the idea that as a photographer, we''re not much different to fishermen?<br/>I do.<br/>All the time.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice capture!You''ve gotten the technical and the abstract issues all working together nicely in order to ensure a great image. I''m convinced. *10* Do you ever get the idea that as a photographer, we''re not much different to fishermen?I do.All the time. Good luck!', '2006-07-09 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603669, 356706, 39598, '<td valign="top">What is that blur above the windmill to the left and forefront of the image?<br/>It spoils what is otherwise a damn fine shot, and very nearly would have walked away with a definite 10 from me.</td>', 'What is that blur above the windmill to the left and forefront of the image?It spoils what is otherwise a damn fine shot, and very nearly would have walked away with a definite 10 from me.', '2006-07-09 18:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603675, 355114, 39598, '<td valign="top">Ah.<br/>But what exactly is it that is stationary?<br/>Your photo gives me no clue...</td>', 'Ah.But what exactly is it that is stationary?Your photo gives me no clue...', '2006-07-09 18:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603696, 356464, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like your dof.<br/>I don''t think your model much cares for your sharpening, and as far as portraiture is concerned, her facial fluff really shouldn''t be so clearly visible.<br/>With that said, your composition was carefully considered, and I, as a viewer appreciate that.<br/>I do, however, get the feeling that it would benefit either from the addition of some external lighting, (with a coloured gel, perhaps) or a slight change of view, hopefully to bring out some colours in the background which would be more complementary to the model''s skin.<br/>A good image "pops" off the page.<br/> <br/>Take heart!<br/>You have an eye for photos, and you''ll be great.</td>', 'I like your dof.I don''t think your model much cares for your sharpening, and as far as portraiture is concerned, her facial fluff really shouldn''t be so clearly visible.With that said, your composition was carefully considered, and I, as a viewer appreciate that.I do, however, get the feeling that it would benefit either from the addition of some external lighting, (with a coloured gel, perhaps) or a slight change of view, hopefully to bring out some colours in the background which would be more complementary to the model''s skin.A good image "pops" off the page. Take heart!You have an eye for photos, and you''ll be great.', '2006-07-09 18:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603724, 355927, 39598, '<td valign="top">One feels that the aperture could have been closed down more, in order to shrink that pool of white light above the company sign, together with the other naked bulbs which are in view.<br/>Setting the tripod up 10 steps to the left might also have solved the perspective tilt problem.<br/>The square crop is nice.<br/>The colours are rich, and with just a bit more contrast, this photo would make you want to look at it even more.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'One feels that the aperture could have been closed down more, in order to shrink that pool of white light above the company sign, together with the other naked bulbs which are in view.Setting the tripod up 10 steps to the left might also have solved the perspective tilt problem.The square crop is nice.The colours are rich, and with just a bit more contrast, this photo would make you want to look at it even more.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603735, 358612, 39598, '<td valign="top">Call me old-fashioned, but I like the silhouette, I does, guv''ner!</td>', 'Call me old-fashioned, but I like the silhouette, I does, guv''ner!', '2006-07-09 18:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603741, 357999, 39598, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a tricky beast.<br/>Too little is a flat photo.<br/>Enough is enough.<br/>Too much is lost detail.<br/>Somehow, one feels that detail was needed in this shot.<br/>Could be a monitor calibration problem methinks...</td>', 'Contrast is a tricky beast.Too little is a flat photo.Enough is enough.Too much is lost detail.Somehow, one feels that detail was needed in this shot.Could be a monitor calibration problem methinks...', '2006-07-09 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603748, 356050, 39598, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is slightly skew.</td>', 'Your horizon is slightly skew.', '2006-07-09 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603754, 356297, 39598, '<td valign="top">Pity about all those reflections...<br/>I can see you, and your lighting equipment<br/>And your tripod, I think.</td>', 'Pity about all those reflections...I can see you, and your lighting equipmentAnd your tripod, I think.', '2006-07-09 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603767, 357823, 39598, '<td valign="top">I think you have a really nice photo here.<br/>This would make any mommy or daddy real proud!<br/>On a technical note, I would go for a flatter crop in order to emphasise a wider angle, and to give flow to the direction he''s looking in.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I think you have a really nice photo here.This would make any mommy or daddy real proud!On a technical note, I would go for a flatter crop in order to emphasise a wider angle, and to give flow to the direction he''s looking in.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603772, 354880, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots which is just begging for a Joey Lawrence grungification! It has all the colour and the depth to make a masterpiece of his technique out of.<br/>You should PM him and see if he''d be keen...<br/>I for one would love to see the end result of that.</td>', 'This is one of those shots which is just begging for a Joey Lawrence grungification! It has all the colour and the depth to make a masterpiece of his technique out of.You should PM him and see if he''d be keen...I for one would love to see the end result of that.', '2006-07-09 18:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603779, 358137, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.<br/>Whoohoo!<br/>Someone got broadband!<br/>If that''s what the reels were for...</td>', 'This is a nice shot.Whoohoo!Someone got broadband!If that''s what the reels were for...', '2006-07-09 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603789, 358096, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is a nice usage of a wide angle lens, with a good choice of composition and time of day for taking the shot.<br/>Your colours are vivid and everything is in focus, as this shot demands.<br/>The curving horizon would be my one complaint - ironically.</td>', 'This is a nice usage of a wide angle lens, with a good choice of composition and time of day for taking the shot.Your colours are vivid and everything is in focus, as this shot demands.The curving horizon would be my one complaint - ironically.', '2006-07-09 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603805, 356654, 39598, '<td valign="top">There are those who will give you grief over your narrow dof.<br/>They can go and get knotted.<br/>The viewer''s attention is held by the head of the insect and the shapes sticking out of the flower (whatever the technical terms may be..).<br/>The softened detail smoothly rounds out the picture, without interfering with what matters.<br/>In all, you''ve succeeded in painting a beautiful picture with colours and shapes, while saying what needed to be said with this outstanding photo.<br/>Good luck!<br/>*10*<br/>(And I really do mean knotted...)</td>', 'There are those who will give you grief over your narrow dof.They can go and get knotted.The viewer''s attention is held by the head of the insect and the shapes sticking out of the flower (whatever the technical terms may be..).The softened detail smoothly rounds out the picture, without interfering with what matters.In all, you''ve succeeded in painting a beautiful picture with colours and shapes, while saying what needed to be said with this outstanding photo.Good luck!*10*(And I really do mean knotted...)', '2006-07-09 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603813, 358144, 39598, '<td valign="top">You, my friend, are not well...<br/>Pity about the unneccesary detail in the background.</td>', 'You, my friend, are not well...Pity about the unneccesary detail in the background.', '2006-07-09 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603835, 355118, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like what you were trying to do with this one.<br/>I am a big fan of narrow dof, but in this case, having lost focus on the pieces in the foreground, you''ve over-exposed the piece in the background, and left the viewer with nothing much to focus on, if you''ll pardon the pun.<br/>The remaining highlights in this image (white squares and black piece light reflections) are too dark, and too close to the shadow levels to provide any real contrast or "pop", to the photo.<br/>So, in all, it comes across as flat with no real attention grabber.<br/>It was a well thought out idea lacking some technical finishing.<br/>Better luck next time!</td>', 'I like what you were trying to do with this one.I am a big fan of narrow dof, but in this case, having lost focus on the pieces in the foreground, you''ve over-exposed the piece in the background, and left the viewer with nothing much to focus on, if you''ll pardon the pun.The remaining highlights in this image (white squares and black piece light reflections) are too dark, and too close to the shadow levels to provide any real contrast or "pop", to the photo.So, in all, it comes across as flat with no real attention grabber.It was a well thought out idea lacking some technical finishing.Better luck next time!', '2006-07-09 19:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603845, 356373, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect!</td>', 'Perfect!', '2006-07-09 19:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603848, 356363, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like the colours a lot.<br/>It has that poster feel about it.<br/>The shore line on the far side is nice and level too.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I like the colours a lot.It has that poster feel about it.The shore line on the far side is nice and level too.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603853, 356454, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones used; a bit oversharpened.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Very nice tones used; a bit oversharpened.  I like the composition.', '2006-07-09 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
