(2603864, 357489, 39598, '<td valign="top">There are 10 million bicycles in Beijing...<br/>I would have liked to have seen some faces.<br/>Or maybe even only one.</td>', 'There are 10 million bicycles in Beijing...I would have liked to have seen some faces.Or maybe even only one.', '2006-07-09 19:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603872, 355084, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is an original idea.<br/>It would look good on someone''s wall if the mirror was clean.<br/>I''m serious.<br/>That''s the only reason I''m faulting it.</td>', 'This is an original idea.It would look good on someone''s wall if the mirror was clean.I''m serious.That''s the only reason I''m faulting it.', '2006-07-09 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603883, 355551, 39598, '<td valign="top">I like it!<br/>Sometimes it is that which is not said that does all the talking.<br/>And this one speaks loud and clear.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I like it!Sometimes it is that which is not said that does all the talking.And this one speaks loud and clear.Good luck!', '2006-07-09 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603898, 356042, 39598, '<td valign="top">Somewhat unnatural colour cast, but effective and striking none-the-less.<br/>Some weird looking (USM?) halos around the boats on the right...<br/>The post processing is what is faulting this image, as the abstract and technical issues leading up to that point all look fine to me.</td>', 'Somewhat unnatural colour cast, but effective and striking none-the-less.Some weird looking (USM?) halos around the boats on the right...The post processing is what is faulting this image, as the abstract and technical issues leading up to that point all look fine to me.', '2006-07-09 19:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603906, 355916, 39598, '<td valign="top">That''s rather a bleak statement to make...<br/>Fortunately I have a more optimistic take on the future of your photograph.<br/>It''s good!<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'That''s rather a bleak statement to make...Fortunately I have a more optimistic take on the future of your photograph.It''s good!Good luck!', '2006-07-09 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603911, 355916, 29451, '<td valign="top">The best in this challenge, just perfect.  Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'The best in this challenge, just perfect.  Adding to my favorites.', '2006-07-09 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603935, 355500, 39598, '<td valign="top">First off, let me tell you that I love your narrow dof.<br/>Let me also warn you that there are those among us who won''t.<br/>Tough cookies for them.<br/>Narrow dof is what allows us to paint with colours and shapes, because non-essentail things within the bounds of the shot become reduced to abstract colours and shapes when we throw them out of focus.<br/> <br/>Your colours and lighting are all good for me.<br/>And the placing of the bag lends nice visual interplay between itself, the row of lights, and the open door(?) in the far distance.<br/>What detracts from this photo, however, is all those off centre lines and angles.<br/>And unfortunately I can''t get past looking at them.<br/>Better luck next time.<br/> <br/>Tough cookies, I tell you!</td>', 'First off, let me tell you that I love your narrow dof.Let me also warn you that there are those among us who won''t.Tough cookies for them.Narrow dof is what allows us to paint with colours and shapes, because non-essentail things within the bounds of the shot become reduced to abstract colours and shapes when we throw them out of focus. Your colours and lighting are all good for me.And the placing of the bag lends nice visual interplay between itself, the row of lights, and the open door(?) in the far distance.What detracts from this photo, however, is all those off centre lines and angles.And unfortunately I can''t get past looking at them.Better luck next time. Tough cookies, I tell you!', '2006-07-09 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2603963, 358092, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great picture overall.  But, even as a fan of borders - I gotta say this one is taking away from the picture.  It is very heavy and holds my eye (attention).</td>', 'Great picture overall.  But, even as a fan of borders - I gotta say this one is taking away from the picture.  It is very heavy and holds my eye (attention).', '2006-07-09 19:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
