(2606212, 356282, 61871, '<td valign="top">Very Brave!</td>', 'Very Brave!', '2006-07-10 07:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606219, 357502, 61679, '<td valign="top">You did a very nice job of capturing this image without blowing out the details in the flower pedals.  However, the busy background tends to hide those details, as the flower sort of blends in and fails to hold my attention for an length of time.   I can''t think of any way to improve this image because the background is what it is.</td>', 'You did a very nice job of capturing this image without blowing out the details in the flower pedals.  However, the busy background tends to hide those details, as the flower sort of blends in and fails to hold my attention for an length of time.   I can''t think of any way to improve this image because the background is what it is.', '2006-07-10 07:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606221, 354802, 61871, '<td valign="top">You may land !</td>', 'You may land !', '2006-07-10 07:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606239, 357021, 61679, '<td valign="top">The use of negative space in this image is very effective.  I would have like to have seen a bit more saturation in the butterfly.</td>', 'The use of negative space in this image is very effective.  I would have like to have seen a bit more saturation in the butterfly.', '2006-07-10 08:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606244, 358287, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the subject you choose for this challenge and the composition very much.  You might want to consider straightening the horizon and playing around with levels and saturation to give this image a little more pop.</td>', 'I like the subject you choose for this challenge and the composition very much.  You might want to consider straightening the horizon and playing around with levels and saturation to give this image a little more pop.', '2006-07-10 08:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606256, 355732, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image definitely conveys a windless day.  You might want to consider using a vertical crop instead of a square crop for this image, as the negative space on the left draws attention away from the windmills more than complementing the windmills.  The image also has a flat look overall and could use a little post processing help.</td>', 'This image definitely conveys a windless day.  You might want to consider using a vertical crop instead of a square crop for this image, as the negative space on the left draws attention away from the windmills more than complementing the windmills.  The image also has a flat look overall and could use a little post processing help.', '2006-07-10 08:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606266, 354880, 61871, '<td valign="top">Wow Nice!</td>', 'Wow Nice!', '2006-07-10 08:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606277, 355231, 61679, '<td valign="top">This car has definitely not moved for a some time.  My only suggestion is that you might try shooting this from a little lower angle to elimnate the sky and tree showing through the gap in the hood.  I''ve looked at this image a couple of times before commenting and each time those items draw my eyes away from the wonderful detail of the engine area visible through the headlight opening.</td>', 'This car has definitely not moved for a some time.  My only suggestion is that you might try shooting this from a little lower angle to elimnate the sky and tree showing through the gap in the hood.  I''ve looked at this image a couple of times before commenting and each time those items draw my eyes away from the wonderful detail of the engine area visible through the headlight opening.', '2006-07-10 08:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606279, 357538, 61679, '<td valign="top">I love the detail you captured in the grasshopper.  You may want to try a square crop on this image to eliminate the distraction of the fencepost.</td>', 'I love the detail you captured in the grasshopper.  You may want to try a square crop on this image to eliminate the distraction of the fencepost.', '2006-07-10 08:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606283, 357842, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not a hint of a breeze.  This image suffers from the limitation of the basic editing rules.  The background really needs to be darken a little bit to help bring out the wonderful detail you captured in the flag.</td>', 'Not a hint of a breeze.  This image suffers from the limitation of the basic editing rules.  The background really needs to be darken a little bit to help bring out the wonderful detail you captured in the flag.', '2006-07-10 08:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606289, 356614, 61679, '<td valign="top">You have captured a very fun image to look at.  Obviously the horse moving somewhat to produce the facial expression you captured.  On the technical side, you might want to try a square crop on this image to eliminate the building in the background and to really bring the focal point back to the main subject.  As presented, my eyes wondered around a bit trying to find what is so funny.</td>', 'You have captured a very fun image to look at.  Obviously the horse moving somewhat to produce the facial expression you captured.  On the technical side, you might want to try a square crop on this image to eliminate the building in the background and to really bring the focal point back to the main subject.  As presented, my eyes wondered around a bit trying to find what is so funny.', '2006-07-10 08:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606295, 355551, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is a very wonderful image with great eye appeal.  The ripples in the water are what makes this refection so appealing; however, the same ripples convey motion within the image itself.</td>', 'This is a very wonderful image with great eye appeal.  The ripples in the water are what makes this refection so appealing; however, the same ripples convey motion within the image itself.', '2006-07-10 08:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606309, 358413, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell if this guy is stationary or in motion ;-). The lighting on the head really brings out the detail and the limited depth of focus on the shell helps lead my eye to those details.  Not a lot of WoW factor to this image but it is very nicely done.</td>', 'Hard to tell if this guy is stationary or in motion ;-). The lighting on the head really brings out the detail and the limited depth of focus on the shell helps lead my eye to those details.  Not a lot of WoW factor to this image but it is very nicely done.', '2006-07-10 08:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606322, 358308, 61679, '<td valign="top">Technically the trees and the cell phone tower are stationary but the overall feel of the image does convey a considerable amount of motion.  The clouds have a stormy feel and the wind that comes with it.  The image also suffers from soft focus, which could be caused by downsizing the image or camera movement associated with too slow of shutter speed.  Compounding the soft feel is the flat overall look of the image.  A little post processing work with levels and saturation would give this image a bit more PoP.</td>', 'Technically the trees and the cell phone tower are stationary but the overall feel of the image does convey a considerable amount of motion.  The clouds have a stormy feel and the wind that comes with it.  The image also suffers from soft focus, which could be caused by downsizing the image or camera movement associated with too slow of shutter speed.  Compounding the soft feel is the flat overall look of the image.  A little post processing work with levels and saturation would give this image a bit more PoP.', '2006-07-10 08:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606324, 358582, 61679, '<td valign="top">A lovely image that is well composed.  The colors and light balance do suffer from the restrictions of basic editing.</td>', 'A lovely image that is well composed.  The colors and light balance do suffer from the restrictions of basic editing.', '2006-07-10 08:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606344, 358233, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is perfect for this challenge.  I''m not sure if B&amp;W is the best choice for this image, as the girl''s torso and upper legs tend to blend into the sand.  Maybe if you played around with the contrast or levels you could bring these details back.</td>', 'This image is perfect for this challenge.  I''m not sure if B&W is the best choice for this image, as the girl''s torso and upper legs tend to blend into the sand.  Maybe if you played around with the contrast or levels you could bring these details back.', '2006-07-10 08:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606352, 356164, 61679, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed at the tremendous amount of detail you captured in the wings.  However, the catch light in the eyes draws my attention to that area and the focus is a little soft in the eyes for my taste.</td>', 'I''m amazed at the tremendous amount of detail you captured in the wings.  However, the catch light in the eyes draws my attention to that area and the focus is a little soft in the eyes for my taste.', '2006-07-10 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606367, 356433, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is very well done and I love the detail visible on the fly.  You might consider cropping a little off the top, as the vertical line produced by the plant in the background takes away from the visual effect of the curves from the plant the fly is sitting upon.</td>', 'This image is very well done and I love the detail visible on the fly.  You might consider cropping a little off the top, as the vertical line produced by the plant in the background takes away from the visual effect of the curves from the plant the fly is sitting upon.', '2006-07-10 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606374, 358690, 61679, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image.  I had to look really hard to see that both feet were actually on the twig.  Only a couple of things could have improved this image.  If the bird would have provided a profile view and a bit more detail in the sky (Tough to do with basic editing).</td>', 'What a wonderful image.  I had to look really hard to see that both feet were actually on the twig.  Only a couple of things could have improved this image.  If the bird would have provided a profile view and a bit more detail in the sky (Tough to do with basic editing).', '2006-07-10 08:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606390, 357637, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image would probaly have bette appeal to the masses if the girl was floating on the water instead of being submerged under the water.  You might want to consider croping the right side of the image to mirror the crop through the elbow on the left side of the image.  As presented, the negative space on the right gives this image an unbalanced feel.  There are three water related anomalies (air bubbles or components of the main subject breaking through the surface of the water) that distract from the main subject.  One by the hair on the right.  One by her mouth. And one by her right thumb.</td>', 'This image would probaly have bette appeal to the masses if the girl was floating on the water instead of being submerged under the water.  You might want to consider croping the right side of the image to mirror the crop through the elbow on the left side of the image.  As presented, the negative space on the right gives this image an unbalanced feel.  There are three water related anomalies (air bubbles or components of the main subject breaking through the surface of the water) that distract from the main subject.  One by the hair on the right.  One by her mouth. And one by her right thumb.', '2006-07-10 09:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606403, 356462, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image but it just doesn''t come across as strongly as it should.  You might want to consider cropping about half of the negative space off the left.  Something about the way the shadows end on the left side draws my focus away from the clock. I might also suggest playing with the contrast, levels or curves to darken the shadow just a touch and maybe lighten the sky.  The sky being darker than the shadows makes the image look a little unbalanced.</td>', 'This is a very nice image but it just doesn''t come across as strongly as it should.  You might want to consider cropping about half of the negative space off the left.  Something about the way the shadows end on the left side draws my focus away from the clock. I might also suggest playing with the contrast, levels or curves to darken the shadow just a touch and maybe lighten the sky.  The sky being darker than the shadows makes the image look a little unbalanced.', '2006-07-10 09:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606418, 355365, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice macro entry.  The detail you captured in the eyes are lost to the viewer due to the blown highlights in the face.</td>', 'A very nice macro entry.  The detail you captured in the eyes are lost to the viewer due to the blown highlights in the face.', '2006-07-10 09:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606423, 356523, 61679, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting are perfect.  The composition would be perfect also if more of the two girls on the left could be seen in silhouette.  You might want to crop this as vertical around the girl on the right hand side of the image.  I think it would be stunning.</td>', 'The colors and lighting are perfect.  The composition would be perfect also if more of the two girls on the left could be seen in silhouette.  You might want to crop this as vertical around the girl on the right hand side of the image.  I think it would be stunning.', '2006-07-10 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606426, 357453, 61679, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel and texture of this image.  It has the look of a painting.  Glad I came back to comment on this one, because it deserves a bump from my first score.</td>', 'I really like the feel and texture of this image.  It has the look of a painting.  Glad I came back to comment on this one, because it deserves a bump from my first score.', '2006-07-10 09:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606433, 357761, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great combination of greens in this image.  You might want to try cropping this as a vertical image to eliminate the out of focus area on the left and the negative space on the right.</td>', 'Great combination of greens in this image.  You might want to try cropping this as a vertical image to eliminate the out of focus area on the left and the negative space on the right.', '2006-07-10 09:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606440, 356853, 61679, '<td valign="top">I find it difficult to determine if this is a full size replica or a minitature.  The lighting is a bit harsh and tends to give the image a washed out look.  There is an object behind the wagon on the far right side that is seems to muddy the details on that side of the image.</td>', 'I find it difficult to determine if this is a full size replica or a minitature.  The lighting is a bit harsh and tends to give the image a washed out look.  There is an object behind the wagon on the far right side that is seems to muddy the details on that side of the image.', '2006-07-10 09:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606442, 356859, 61679, '<td valign="top">What a unique turtle (?).  Might I suggest you try some fill flash the next time you are in this situation to bring out the details in the face.  As presented, the right foot draws as much attention as the eye and the eye should clearly be the focal point.</td>', 'What a unique turtle (?).  Might I suggest you try some fill flash the next time you are in this situation to bring out the details in the face.  As presented, the right foot draws as much attention as the eye and the eye should clearly be the focal point.', '2006-07-10 09:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
