(2606483, 357822, 61679, '<td valign="top">An object that was stationary, stopped being stationary, and is now stationary again.  Can''t find a subject that fits the challenge better than that.  You might want to consider cropping a little off the top to remove the sky.  It really doesn''t add anything to the image but does try to draw attention away from the main subject.  The image would also be improved if the house colors were a bit stronger and the focus a bit sharper.  Try playing around witih saturation and levels in post processing and USM after resizing and see if that helps any.</td>', 'An object that was stationary, stopped being stationary, and is now stationary again.  Can''t find a subject that fits the challenge better than that.  You might want to consider cropping a little off the top to remove the sky.  It really doesn''t add anything to the image but does try to draw attention away from the main subject.  The image would also be improved if the house colors were a bit stronger and the focus a bit sharper.  Try playing around witih saturation and levels in post processing and USM after resizing and see if that helps any.', '2006-07-10 09:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606502, 358431, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice job on producing the silhouette effect.  The sky has some nice coloration and detail.  The positioning of the subject is not the most effective for this challenge.  This pose looks like awkard and does not convey a peaceful look.</td>', 'A nice job on producing the silhouette effect.  The sky has some nice coloration and detail.  The positioning of the subject is not the most effective for this challenge.  This pose looks like awkard and does not convey a peaceful look.', '2006-07-10 09:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
