(2606508, 358257, 61679, '<td valign="top">A great capture and the only thing lacking is the complete reflection of the insect on the left side of the image.  Bumping up from my original score.</td>', 'A great capture and the only thing lacking is the complete reflection of the insect on the left side of the image.  Bumping up from my original score.', '2006-07-10 09:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
