(2606522, 355867, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is very nice and definitely fits the challenge.  I really wish you had taken this image from a slightly different angle to provide a better balance between the front and side of the vehicle.  I can see you were trying to provide an interesting prospective with the angle chosen but there is some wonderful detail along the side of the vehicle that tends to get lost.  I also think shooting from the side more would bring a stronger perspective to the tree branch across the hood.</td>', 'This image is very nice and definitely fits the challenge.  I really wish you had taken this image from a slightly different angle to provide a better balance between the front and side of the vehicle.  I can see you were trying to provide an interesting prospective with the angle chosen but there is some wonderful detail along the side of the vehicle that tends to get lost.  I also think shooting from the side more would bring a stronger perspective to the tree branch across the hood.', '2006-07-10 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606533, 355421, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing mix of colors and shapes.  You might want to consider rotating the image a degree or two, as it looks to be tilted slightly.  The focus appears to be a little soft, which could be a result of downsizing the image or long shutter speed (camera shake).</td>', 'A very pleasing mix of colors and shapes.  You might want to consider rotating the image a degree or two, as it looks to be tilted slightly.  The focus appears to be a little soft, which could be a result of downsizing the image or long shutter speed (camera shake).', '2006-07-10 09:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606537, 358684, 61679, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge but the image has a snapshoot kind of feel to it.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge but the image has a snapshoot kind of feel to it.', '2006-07-10 09:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606544, 356694, 61679, '<td valign="top">I have no doubt that these items were stationary but everyting about the image say motion to me.  It really looks like the objects are in the process of being erected and not really at rest in their final location.</td>', 'I have no doubt that these items were stationary but everyting about the image say motion to me.  It really looks like the objects are in the process of being erected and not really at rest in their final location.', '2006-07-10 10:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606552, 358372, 61679, '<td valign="top">Did you give him a taste or not?  The perspective and cropping of this image makes it fun to look at.  The colors look a little off due to the lighting.</td>', 'Did you give him a taste or not?  The perspective and cropping of this image makes it fun to look at.  The colors look a little off due to the lighting.', '2006-07-10 10:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606560, 356429, 61679, '<td valign="top">The colors are nicely saturated and the lighting works well.  You might want to consider using a square crop for this picture, as the negative space on the left really doesn''t add to image.</td>', 'The colors are nicely saturated and the lighting works well.  You might want to consider using a square crop for this picture, as the negative space on the left really doesn''t add to image.', '2006-07-10 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
