(2606588, 355916, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture, which I underated when I voted.  Sorry I don''t have any suggestions how to improve this image.  I really would like to see the color version after the challenge is complete.  Nice job.</td>', 'A very nice capture, which I underated when I voted.  Sorry I don''t have any suggestions how to improve this image.  I really would like to see the color version after the challenge is complete.  Nice job.', '2006-07-10 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606599, 356236, 61679, '<td valign="top">With basic editing there isn''t much you can do to improve this image for the time of day it was taken.  I would love to see this image with the city darkened more to provide more of a silhouette feel.  The detail in the city doesn''t really add to the picture, as the lighting and colors on Mt. Rainier are wonderful.</td>', 'With basic editing there isn''t much you can do to improve this image for the time of day it was taken.  I would love to see this image with the city darkened more to provide more of a silhouette feel.  The detail in the city doesn''t really add to the picture, as the lighting and colors on Mt. Rainier are wonderful.', '2006-07-10 10:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606602, 358436, 61679, '<td valign="top">This shot would be perfect if the pole wasn''t in front of the steam engine.  The curve of the track and the people in a hurry to board are just wonderful.</td>', 'This shot would be perfect if the pole wasn''t in front of the steam engine.  The curve of the track and the people in a hurry to board are just wonderful.', '2006-07-10 10:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606611, 357382, 61679, '<td valign="top">A wonderful sunflower shot.  The sunflowers in the background on the left really add to this image.  However, the right side looks busy and is given more importance (space) in the image than the flowers on the left side.  Maybe a slightly different angle could have balanced this better.</td>', 'A wonderful sunflower shot.  The sunflowers in the background on the left really add to this image.  However, the right side looks busy and is given more importance (space) in the image than the flowers on the left side.  Maybe a slightly different angle could have balanced this better.', '2006-07-10 10:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606617, 358481, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image could have used a little fill flash.  The positioning of the spider is really good; however, the lighting draws my attention to the plant to the right of the spider instead of on the spider itself.</td>', 'This image could have used a little fill flash.  The positioning of the spider is really good; however, the lighting draws my attention to the plant to the right of the spider instead of on the spider itself.', '2006-07-10 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606629, 358484, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good image for this challenge; however, you might want to try playing with the saturation levels a bit before converting to B&amp;W to see if you can help draw the truck out from the background.</td>', 'This is a pretty good image for this challenge; however, you might want to try playing with the saturation levels a bit before converting to B&W to see if you can help draw the truck out from the background.', '2006-07-10 10:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606641, 355434, 61679, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this image is very dramatic.  The subject matter of the silhouette is hard to distinguish and might be improve if shot from a slightly different angle.</td>', 'The lighting in this image is very dramatic.  The subject matter of the silhouette is hard to distinguish and might be improve if shot from a slightly different angle.', '2006-07-10 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606646, 356486, 61679, '<td valign="top">The technical aspects of this image are well done and I can''t think of one thing to improve it.  The image itself has a stock photo type of emotion to it and your score suffers a little when compared to the large number of images that have more emotion in them.</td>', 'The technical aspects of this image are well done and I can''t think of one thing to improve it.  The image itself has a stock photo type of emotion to it and your score suffers a little when compared to the large number of images that have more emotion in them.', '2006-07-10 10:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606658, 358519, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice image that is very well done.  However, there are several similar images in this challenge which diminishes the wow factor of your entry.  This image deserves to score in the sixes.</td>', 'A very nice image that is very well done.  However, there are several similar images in this challenge which diminishes the wow factor of your entry.  This image deserves to score in the sixes.', '2006-07-10 10:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606662, 358395, 61679, '<td valign="top">A stationary object that conveys motion is a refreshing take on this challenge.  The exposure and focus are spot on.  Not as high on the emotional wow factor as some of the other entries but a superb picture.</td>', 'A stationary object that conveys motion is a refreshing take on this challenge.  The exposure and focus are spot on.  Not as high on the emotional wow factor as some of the other entries but a superb picture.', '2006-07-10 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606669, 355084, 61679, '<td valign="top">A unique perspective and the B&amp;W give a definite urban feel.  However, there is very little difference in tonality and contrast between the various concrete structure and I''m left to wonder if this image might have been more effective in color.</td>', 'A unique perspective and the B&W give a definite urban feel.  However, there is very little difference in tonality and contrast between the various concrete structure and I''m left to wonder if this image might have been more effective in color.', '2006-07-10 10:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606678, 358629, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very lovely sunset and worthy of a solid score.  However, the subject matter isn''t emotionally strong for a stationary challenge.</td>', 'A very lovely sunset and worthy of a solid score.  However, the subject matter isn''t emotionally strong for a stationary challenge.', '2006-07-10 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606696, 358606, 61679, '<td valign="top">A pleasant enough image with great colors but it doesn''t convey much effort on your part towards this challenge.  There is tremedous detail in the hydrant; however, there is equal amount of detail in the fence in the background.  Perhaps if you reshoot this image in different lighting it would add some character giving contrast to the hydrant and decrease the features in the background.</td>', 'A pleasant enough image with great colors but it doesn''t convey much effort on your part towards this challenge.  There is tremedous detail in the hydrant; however, there is equal amount of detail in the fence in the background.  Perhaps if you reshoot this image in different lighting it would add some character giving contrast to the hydrant and decrease the features in the background.', '2006-07-10 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606704, 357045, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice B&amp;W conversion.  A couple of suggestions for improvement.  First, include a little bit more of the stump in the bottom of the image.  It is just as important  to show what the hatchet is stuck in as it is to show that it is stuck.  Second, the focus looks to be sharper on the end of the handle than on the head of the hatchet.  This tends to draw my eyes to the left edge of the photo and away from the main subject.</td>', 'A very nice B&W conversion.  A couple of suggestions for improvement.  First, include a little bit more of the stump in the bottom of the image.  It is just as important  to show what the hatchet is stuck in as it is to show that it is stuck.  Second, the focus looks to be sharper on the end of the handle than on the head of the hatchet.  This tends to draw my eyes to the left edge of the photo and away from the main subject.', '2006-07-10 10:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606712, 358677, 61679, '<td valign="top">You found a very good subject for this challenge but there are a couple of issues that are hurting your score.  First, I wish you would have removed the water bottle from the empty bench before taking this image.  Second, you might want to try cropping this image so that the empty bench is the same distance from the edge as the occupied bench.  This would really help balance this image and remove the red tile distraction on the left side of the photo.  An added benefit to this crop would be the lightest part of the image would be on the far right, which would naturally draw your eyes from the empty bench to the occupied bench and evoke a comparison of the two.</td>', 'You found a very good subject for this challenge but there are a couple of issues that are hurting your score.  First, I wish you would have removed the water bottle from the empty bench before taking this image.  Second, you might want to try cropping this image so that the empty bench is the same distance from the edge as the occupied bench.  This would really help balance this image and remove the red tile distraction on the left side of the photo.  An added benefit to this crop would be the lightest part of the image would be on the far right, which would naturally draw your eyes from the empty bench to the occupied bench and evoke a comparison of the two.', '2006-07-10 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606717, 356263, 61679, '<td valign="top">The positioning of the dragonfly and the detail in the wings are wonderful.  However, the blown highlights and soft focus in the eyes hurt the overall quality of this image.</td>', 'The positioning of the dragonfly and the detail in the wings are wonderful.  However, the blown highlights and soft focus in the eyes hurt the overall quality of this image.', '2006-07-10 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
