(2606907, 358296, 55199, '<td valign="top">W.C. --&gt; water closets?  Thats A LOT of porta-potties!  I wish there were something in the photo to better show what these are.  A color photo may have done this better, although the duotone is kinda nice.  I think I''d like either more image on the left of your photo, or a slightly different angle so the terminal point of your perspective isn''t nearly crashing into the edge of the photo. Unique subject matter with lots of potential, and in my opinion meets the challenge.  :)</td>', 'W.C. --> water closets?  Thats A LOT of porta-potties!  I wish there were something in the photo to better show what these are.  A color photo may have done this better, although the duotone is kinda nice.  I think I''d like either more image on the left of your photo, or a slightly different angle so the terminal point of your perspective isn''t nearly crashing into the edge of the photo. Unique subject matter with lots of potential, and in my opinion meets the challenge.  :)', '2006-07-10 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
