(2609983, 358460, 59754, '<td valign="top">The ffect on this photo, be it bad compression or intentional, unfortunately bothers my eyes.  A certain artifacty grain seems to cover the entire picture, and it is not pleasing to look at.  The border also seems out of place, a bit too big and perhaps unnecessary at all.</td>', 'The ffect on this photo, be it bad compression or intentional, unfortunately bothers my eyes.  A certain artifacty grain seems to cover the entire picture, and it is not pleasing to look at.  The border also seems out of place, a bit too big and perhaps unnecessary at all.', '2006-07-11 03:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
