(2610027, 358426, 59754, '<td valign="top">I don''t think something is stationary just because it''s not moving <i>at the point you shot it.</i> <br/> <br/>I guess I can give the benefit of the doubt for this one.  Very cute little guy.</td>', 'I don''t think something is stationary just because it''s not moving at the point you shot it.  I guess I can give the benefit of the doubt for this one.  Very cute little guy.', '2006-07-11 03:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610029, 358097, 59754, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy focus.</td>', 'A little fuzzy focus.', '2006-07-11 03:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610088, 356314, 56238, '<td valign="top">I like the luminosity and shadows.  And of course I love your interpretation!</td>', 'I like the luminosity and shadows.  And of course I love your interpretation!', '2006-07-11 05:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610094, 358532, 56238, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the implied TV.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the implied TV.  Nice DOF.', '2006-07-11 05:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610098, 356965, 56238, '<td valign="top">i like the combination of colours and the DOF works great.  Well spotted.</td>', 'i like the combination of colours and the DOF works great.  Well spotted.', '2006-07-11 05:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610100, 355118, 56238, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I think you did well with a difficult dynamic range.</td>', 'Nice composition, I think you did well with a difficult dynamic range.', '2006-07-11 05:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610101, 356464, 56238, '<td valign="top">nicely done, I like the close crop and the natural looking hair. Would the fingers have been distracting if they were in focus?</td>', 'nicely done, I like the close crop and the natural looking hair. Would the fingers have been distracting if they were in focus?', '2006-07-11 05:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610104, 358092, 56238, '<td valign="top">I like the red and green combination.  Looks like a picture with a story to tell.</td>', 'I like the red and green combination.  Looks like a picture with a story to tell.', '2006-07-11 05:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610107, 358419, 56238, '<td valign="top">I love reflection photos, this is a very well done one.</td>', 'I love reflection photos, this is a very well done one.', '2006-07-11 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610114, 357436, 56238, '<td valign="top">Very well spotted.  Stationary indeed!</td>', 'Very well spotted.  Stationary indeed!', '2006-07-11 05:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610118, 357643, 56238, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Does not look dark and gloomy at all..</td>', 'Very well done.  Does not look dark and gloomy at all..', '2006-07-11 05:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610119, 357998, 56238, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the water drops and the smile.</td>', 'Nice detail on the water drops and the smile.', '2006-07-11 05:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610132, 357194, 56238, '<td valign="top">Love the colours.  There is nothing that says stationary quite like still water.</td>', 'Love the colours.  There is nothing that says stationary quite like still water.', '2006-07-11 06:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610135, 357518, 56238, '<td valign="top">Nice colour combo.  I also like the detail in the shadows without losing too much in the white topsides.</td>', 'Nice colour combo.  I also like the detail in the shadows without losing too much in the white topsides.', '2006-07-11 06:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610150, 355434, 56238, '<td valign="top">I really like the halo!</td>', 'I really like the halo!', '2006-07-11 06:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610157, 355917, 56238, '<td valign="top">Good choice to do it in sepia.  I also like the downcast eyes.</td>', 'Good choice to do it in sepia.  I also like the downcast eyes.', '2006-07-11 06:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610160, 358363, 56238, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections</td>', 'I like the reflections', '2006-07-11 06:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610194, 358143, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think you choose the wrong time of day to shot this image.  The sun is very harsh and has blown out the highlights in the hats.  The main composition is fine; however the background is very cluttered and distracting.  You might want to consider using a tight crop on this image to minimize the busy background.  If your crop just barely touched the hair of the main monkeys on the outside edge of each, it could help this image.  Don''t be afraid to play around a bit.</td>', 'I think you choose the wrong time of day to shot this image.  The sun is very harsh and has blown out the highlights in the hats.  The main composition is fine; however the background is very cluttered and distracting.  You might want to consider using a tight crop on this image to minimize the busy background.  If your crop just barely touched the hair of the main monkeys on the outside edge of each, it could help this image.  Don''t be afraid to play around a bit.', '2006-07-11 07:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610198, 357531, 61679, '<td valign="top">Your focus point bing the darkest statue is spot on.  You might want to consider cropping the top a little bit to eliminate the gray area in the top left corner.</td>', 'Your focus point bing the darkest statue is spot on.  You might want to consider cropping the top a little bit to eliminate the gray area in the top left corner.', '2006-07-11 07:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610206, 357289, 61679, '<td valign="top">The rock face is definitely the main subject here and definitely fits the challenge; however, something keeps drawing my eyes to the back of the image.  Part of it is the snow I think, as brighter areas tend to draw attention.  Anothe part is the line of plant life leading from the front of the image back to the mountain range.  Perhaps if you saturated the colors of the rock face at tad more it would hold the viewers attention better.</td>', 'The rock face is definitely the main subject here and definitely fits the challenge; however, something keeps drawing my eyes to the back of the image.  Part of it is the snow I think, as brighter areas tend to draw attention.  Anothe part is the line of plant life leading from the front of the image back to the mountain range.  Perhaps if you saturated the colors of the rock face at tad more it would hold the viewers attention better.', '2006-07-11 07:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610209, 358475, 61679, '<td valign="top">Exceptional work on the B&amp;W conversion.  Glad I came back to comment on this, as I underated it the first time.  Enjoy the bump.</td>', 'Exceptional work on the B&W conversion.  Glad I came back to comment on this, as I underated it the first time.  Enjoy the bump.', '2006-07-11 07:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610216, 358432, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot under tough shooting conditions.  My only suggestion is to crop a little off the right side to eliminate the plants across the street.  The corner of your display window provides a leading line right to it and my naturally followed.</td>', 'A very nice shot under tough shooting conditions.  My only suggestion is to crop a little off the right side to eliminate the plants across the street.  The corner of your display window provides a leading line right to it and my naturally followed.', '2006-07-11 07:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610222, 358532, 61679, '<td valign="top">The exposure and composition of this image is perfect.  The eyes are a bit over the top on the girl on the left, which looks cartoonish compared the girl on the right.  You might want to try a black border for this image, as the red one just doesn''t look right.</td>', 'The exposure and composition of this image is perfect.  The eyes are a bit over the top on the girl on the left, which looks cartoonish compared the girl on the right.  You might want to try a black border for this image, as the red one just doesn''t look right.', '2006-07-11 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610236, 356444, 61679, '<td valign="top">What makes this always stationary object a strong subject for a stationary challenge is the movement caused by the wind in the grass and the tree. The placement of the light house in the center of the composition works well in this image because of the tree.  At first I thought the image could use a little straightening; however, I believe it is an optical illusion caused by the shadows.  Although the person adds perspective to the image, he does provide a distraction, as my eyes keep trying to see a little more detail in him.  Very nice image.</td>', 'What makes this always stationary object a strong subject for a stationary challenge is the movement caused by the wind in the grass and the tree. The placement of the light house in the center of the composition works well in this image because of the tree.  At first I thought the image could use a little straightening; however, I believe it is an optical illusion caused by the shadows.  Although the person adds perspective to the image, he does provide a distraction, as my eyes keep trying to see a little more detail in him.  Very nice image.', '2006-07-11 08:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610244, 357386, 61679, '<td valign="top">The focus and exposure of this image is well done.  The subject matter doesn''t really provide any emotional attachment to the photo.  I also found myself wanting to see the top of the bulb where the filiment is located.</td>', 'The focus and exposure of this image is well done.  The subject matter doesn''t really provide any emotional attachment to the photo.  I also found myself wanting to see the top of the bulb where the filiment is located.', '2006-07-11 08:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610245, 357055, 61679, '<td valign="top">Sorry but stopping the action doesn''t convey stationary to me.  Good capture but weak on the challenge subject. 5</td>', 'Sorry but stopping the action doesn''t convey stationary to me.  Good capture but weak on the challenge subject. 5', '2006-07-11 08:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610248, 358566, 61679, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image says she should be moving, the people around her, the walk sign.  However, her eyes make it look like she is distracted by something and forgot to move when the sign changed from Don''t Walk to Walk.  Still, she is definitly stationary and the B&amp;W conversion is well done. 8</td>', 'Everything about this image says she should be moving, the people around her, the walk sign.  However, her eyes make it look like she is distracted by something and forgot to move when the sign changed from Don''t Walk to Walk.  Still, she is definitly stationary and the B&W conversion is well done. 8', '2006-07-11 08:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610249, 356906, 61679, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks very close to what you were intending.  The high key effect works well here. 8</td>', 'I bet this looks very close to what you were intending.  The high key effect works well here. 8', '2006-07-11 08:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610254, 358296, 61679, '<td valign="top">Wow, this image looks like something is moving but everything is stationary.  Great job. 8</td>', 'Wow, this image looks like something is moving but everything is stationary.  Great job. 8', '2006-07-11 08:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610259, 355119, 61679, '<td valign="top">Very funny image, which gave me my chuckle for the day.  Too bad the back leg is missing on the back side.  Great entry and very creative.</td>', 'Very funny image, which gave me my chuckle for the day.  Too bad the back leg is missing on the back side.  Great entry and very creative.', '2006-07-11 08:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610270, 355939, 61679, '<td valign="top">I gave this image a seven and I know you are going to wonder why it wasn''t a ribbon winner.  So I feel compelled to comment. First, this image is technically perfect, the lighting, the focus, the placement of the subject.  However, the use of seamless paper in the background works against this image.  It takes away from the spontaneity that you are trying to convey by making the picture looked posed.  I have no doubt that you had the subject move around and freeze when the music stopped but it just doesn''t come across with this background.  A neutral colored background may have worked better.</td>', 'I gave this image a seven and I know you are going to wonder why it wasn''t a ribbon winner.  So I feel compelled to comment. First, this image is technically perfect, the lighting, the focus, the placement of the subject.  However, the use of seamless paper in the background works against this image.  It takes away from the spontaneity that you are trying to convey by making the picture looked posed.  I have no doubt that you had the subject move around and freeze when the music stopped but it just doesn''t come across with this background.  A neutral colored background may have worked better.', '2006-07-11 08:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610277, 358030, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and background on this image and the detail in the withered rose pedals is exceptional.  This image is interesting to the point that I wish I could look at it from several different angles.  You have the misfortune that this particular challenge has several entries that with pop.  The subtleties of this entry will probably get lost among them.  Bump to a 7.</td>', 'I like the lighting and background on this image and the detail in the withered rose pedals is exceptional.  This image is interesting to the point that I wish I could look at it from several different angles.  You have the misfortune that this particular challenge has several entries that with pop.  The subtleties of this entry will probably get lost among them.  Bump to a 7.', '2006-07-11 08:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610280, 355500, 61679, '<td valign="top">The tools look a little new to be working tools.  PLus a skilled trademan would never leave his tools behind.  Nice image in spite of my nit-picking.</td>', 'The tools look a little new to be working tools.  PLus a skilled trademan would never leave his tools behind.  Nice image in spite of my nit-picking.', '2006-07-11 08:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610282, 356039, 61679, '<td valign="top">A very nice image and very suitable for this challenge.  A couple of suggestions you might want to consider.  First,  crop a little off the right side just past the barn window.  As presented, the highlights off the barn roof compete against the tractor for my attention.  Second, play around with contrast, saturation, and levels a bit to see if you can provied more depth to the tractor.  It looks a little flat in this lighting.</td>', 'A very nice image and very suitable for this challenge.  A couple of suggestions you might want to consider.  First,  crop a little off the right side just past the barn window.  As presented, the highlights off the barn roof compete against the tractor for my attention.  Second, play around with contrast, saturation, and levels a bit to see if you can provied more depth to the tractor.  It looks a little flat in this lighting.', '2006-07-11 08:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
