(2610595, 357759, 27144, '<td valign="top">The water flow looks great</td>', 'The water flow looks great', '2006-07-11 10:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610649, 356544, 61679, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image.  The image could use a little bit of sharpening.  You might want to consider reshooting this at a different time of day.  The light appears to be directly overhead and is washing out some of the great texture available at the end of the log.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image.  The image could use a little bit of sharpening.  You might want to consider reshooting this at a different time of day.  The light appears to be directly overhead and is washing out some of the great texture available at the end of the log.', '2006-07-11 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610662, 358419, 61679, '<td valign="top">The water trail behind the canoe truly does convey the stillness of the water.  I gave this image a 9 and I wouldn''t be surprised to see it in the top 10 or even ribbon.  However this image may have been even better if you would have left out the tree in the foreground, as it breaks up the continuity of the still water and the sky just a touch.</td>', 'The water trail behind the canoe truly does convey the stillness of the water.  I gave this image a 9 and I wouldn''t be surprised to see it in the top 10 or even ribbon.  However this image may have been even better if you would have left out the tree in the foreground, as it breaks up the continuity of the still water and the sky just a touch.', '2006-07-11 10:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610673, 356965, 61679, '<td valign="top">I have to bump this to a 10 upon further reveiw.  I love the alignment of the trucks and the mix of color.  A couple of minor tweaks you may want to consider.  First, try straightening the image so the "bars" are vertical.  Second, crop the image to remove the partial "bar" on the left.  It might even be worthwhile to crop most of the white truck out and clone out the rest once the restrictions of basic editing are done.</td>', 'I have to bump this to a 10 upon further reveiw.  I love the alignment of the trucks and the mix of color.  A couple of minor tweaks you may want to consider.  First, try straightening the image so the "bars" are vertical.  Second, crop the image to remove the partial "bar" on the left.  It might even be worthwhile to crop most of the white truck out and clone out the rest once the restrictions of basic editing are done.', '2006-07-11 10:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610676, 357704, 61679, '<td valign="top">This is one of the strongest machinery entries in this challenge.  The play off between the curves of the bucket and the rectangles in the background are wonderful.  I also love how the arm of the bucket is the most saturated color in the image.</td>', 'This is one of the strongest machinery entries in this challenge.  The play off between the curves of the bucket and the rectangles in the background are wonderful.  I also love how the arm of the bucket is the most saturated color in the image.', '2006-07-11 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610755, 356837, 61349, '<td valign="top">nice angle and texture, but remind me, how does it go with the theme?</td>', 'nice angle and texture, but remind me, how does it go with the theme?', '2006-07-11 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610761, 358432, 61349, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but the picture would be better if you didnt have the glare on the glass.</td>', 'interesting idea, but the picture would be better if you didnt have the glare on the glass.', '2006-07-11 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610766, 358096, 54709, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.<br/> <br/>This must be Iceland :)</td>', 'Beautiful colors. This must be Iceland :)', '2006-07-11 11:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610768, 356444, 48228, '<td valign="top">Now this is very good..... I really like tis one and give you a "9".....</td>', 'Now this is very good..... I really like tis one and give you a "9".....', '2006-07-11 11:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610790, 355916, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks as far as photos go for this theme. First I love captures like this. Besides, comp and tones are extraordinary!10</td>', 'One of my top picks as far as photos go for this theme. First I love captures like this. Besides, comp and tones are extraordinary!10', '2006-07-11 12:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610792, 354880, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love this composition, and a really great set-up.....</td>', 'I love this composition, and a really great set-up.....', '2006-07-11 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610793, 356171, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect for theme with an interesting comp and increeddible tones, Shadows add texture. 10</td>', 'Perfect for theme with an interesting comp and increeddible tones, Shadows add texture. 10', '2006-07-11 12:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610794, 356706, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent..... I love this one..... a "10" from me.....</td>', 'Excellent..... I love this one..... a "10" from me.....', '2006-07-11 12:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610937, 356158, 53376, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder about the title. Beyond the cryptic joke, it doesn''t say "stationary."</td>', 'I have to wonder about the title. Beyond the cryptic joke, it doesn''t say "stationary."', '2006-07-11 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610939, 357136, 53376, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and tones. You have a natural frame in the shot. I think it might be better if it were clearly framing something, like the rock or the blowing bush.</td>', 'Excellent exposure and tones. You have a natural frame in the shot. I think it might be better if it were clearly framing something, like the rock or the blowing bush.', '2006-07-11 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610941, 358460, 53376, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting ... doesn''t add anything to the composition.</td>', 'The background is distracting ... doesn''t add anything to the composition.', '2006-07-11 13:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610943, 357729, 53376, '<td valign="top">A tighter composition might help this shot.</td>', 'A tighter composition might help this shot.', '2006-07-11 13:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610944, 358539, 53376, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, although clouds don''t necessarily say "stationary" to me.</td>', 'Very pretty, although clouds don''t necessarily say "stationary" to me.', '2006-07-11 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
