(2610958, 358366, 59194, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette effect.  I would have cropped the yellow mark on the right to obtain a complete silhouette.</td>', 'I like the silhouette effect.  I would have cropped the yellow mark on the right to obtain a complete silhouette.', '2006-07-11 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
