(2612137, 357441, 56744, '<td valign="top">It looks like one of those Magnun Photos. I think B&amp;W will give more impact</td>', 'It looks like one of those Magnun Photos. I think B&W will give more impact', '2006-07-11 21:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
