(2612238, 358378, 57460, '<td valign="top">The colors caught my eye - especially the blue sky</td>', 'The colors caught my eye - especially the blue sky', '2006-07-11 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2612252, 358363, 57460, '<td valign="top">I like night photos, but this one seems to be a little too dark and lacking some details.  I think the photo could have been complimented a little more if the right side was cropped out, because the lights on the right side are of a different hue than the lights on the station, and the bright spot light is a little distracting.  I do like the reflection on the water.  Would be a gorgeous if the water stood a little stiller, to pick up more details in the reflection.  But Mother Nature does as she wishes! : )</td>', 'I like night photos, but this one seems to be a little too dark and lacking some details.  I think the photo could have been complimented a little more if the right side was cropped out, because the lights on the right side are of a different hue than the lights on the station, and the bright spot light is a little distracting.  I do like the reflection on the water.  Would be a gorgeous if the water stood a little stiller, to pick up more details in the reflection.  But Mother Nature does as she wishes! : )', '2006-07-11 22:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2612258, 355873, 57460, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the reflection of light.  I usually am not very fond of borders on pictures, because they usually appear unnecessary, but I feel the simple border you placed works perfectly to compliment the photo.</td>', 'I like the angle and the reflection of light.  I usually am not very fond of borders on pictures, because they usually appear unnecessary, but I feel the simple border you placed works perfectly to compliment the photo.', '2006-07-11 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2612264, 357704, 50695, '<td valign="top">the perfect collage. the crane without its vehicle to "balance" it creates a profound sense of weight. the rest is just an aesthetically pleasing assemblage of shapes and lines and color and textures. A very "flat" image. 9</td>', 'the perfect collage. the crane without its vehicle to "balance" it creates a profound sense of weight. the rest is just an aesthetically pleasing assemblage of shapes and lines and color and textures. A very "flat" image. 9', '2006-07-11 22:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
