(2612970, 356706, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lev!  Looks like you were in my neck of the woods!  You did a nice job of bringing some order and rhythm to these guys. Your colors are excellent.</td>', 'Congrats Lev!  Looks like you were in my neck of the woods!  You did a nice job of bringing some order and rhythm to these guys. Your colors are excellent.', '2006-07-12 01:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
