(2613727, 358030, 58845, '<td valign="top">atupdate, I appreciate your encouraging comments.  I am very pleased with the finish.  I was wishing I could have entered this photo in the ''desolate'' challenge a while back, but the timing wasn''t right.  Thank you for the vote!    Obviously I don''t know how to post a response to a particular commentor, but thank you all for your comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-12 04:16:54.</i></td>', 'atupdate, I appreciate your encouraging comments.  I am very pleased with the finish.  I was wishing I could have entered this photo in the ''desolate'' challenge a while back, but the timing wasn''t right.  Thank you for the vote!    Obviously I don''t know how to post a response to a particular commentor, but thank you all for your comments.', '2006-07-12 05:11:52.000000', '2006-07-12 05:16:54.000000', 0),
