(2614072, 357699, 34938, '<td valign="top">I feel really disappointed for you that this finished so low...this was an excellent shot. 4.991 is not a true indication, and maybe in another challenge it would have done better...sorry that the voters didn''t give this a better score...I LOVE it!</td>', 'I feel really disappointed for you that this finished so low...this was an excellent shot. 4.991 is not a true indication, and maybe in another challenge it would have done better...sorry that the voters didn''t give this a better score...I LOVE it!', '2006-07-12 08:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
