(2615318, 358159, 61679, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised how low the score was on this image.  The composition is very effective at telling the story you intended, the lighting is extremely good, and the focal point and shallow depth of focus could not have better executed.  I gave this an 8 and felt guilty rating it that low.  Nicely done.<br/> <br/>Edited for typo ;-(<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-12 14:42:21.</i></td>', 'I''m surprised how low the score was on this image.  The composition is very effective at telling the story you intended, the lighting is extremely good, and the focal point and shallow depth of focus could not have better executed.  I gave this an 8 and felt guilty rating it that low.  Nicely done. Edited for typo ;-(', '2006-07-12 15:41:40.000000', '2006-07-12 15:42:21.000000', 0),
