(2615594, 357699, 45790, '<td valign="top">I don''t see why this scored as low as it did, unless people thought it DNMC. It''s potential a great portrait, hurt only by some lighting problems -- the dark shadow on the far side of her nose, and her right shoulder both detract from a well posed, framed, and exposed picture.</td>', 'I don''t see why this scored as low as it did, unless people thought it DNMC. It''s potential a great portrait, hurt only by some lighting problems -- the dark shadow on the far side of her nose, and her right shoulder both detract from a well posed, framed, and exposed picture.', '2006-07-12 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
