(2616879, 358137, 59343, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the congrats on my pic.  I love this picture.  The muted tones are still strong but make it look otherworldly.  The detail is fantastic.  I would love to know how you achieved this look--I want to try it sometime.  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Thanks for the congrats on my pic.  I love this picture.  The muted tones are still strong but make it look otherworldly.  The detail is fantastic.  I would love to know how you achieved this look--I want to try it sometime.  Beautiful shot.', '2006-07-12 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
