(2622659, 357443, 20530, '<td valign="top">I can see why you might be upset about your "Progress" score. It looks like you''ve raised your bar with this one.<br/> <br/>I think it looks very "sharpened", but doesn''t strike me as "oversharpened". For this image, I feel like the processing just serves to add interest. Great colors and textures! Nice work.</td>', 'I can see why you might be upset about your "Progress" score. It looks like you''ve raised your bar with this one. I think it looks very "sharpened", but doesn''t strike me as "oversharpened". For this image, I feel like the processing just serves to add interest. Great colors and textures! Nice work.', '2006-07-14 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
