(2642023, 356344, 11854, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> Trading Post - I know this is basc editing but I think it would be possible to use thos erules and make this image stand out a bit more. You hav egood colors to work with and pretty good detail in the boat. I may play with this one a bit if you dont mind. Fits the challenge but overall isnt a stand out image as it stands to help it garner the higher scores. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Play away Tim!</td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: Trading Post - I know this is basc editing but I think it would be possible to use thos erules and make this image stand out a bit more. You hav egood colors to work with and pretty good detail in the boat. I may play with this one a bit if you dont mind. Fits the challenge but overall isnt a stand out image as it stands to help it garner the higher scores.   Play away Tim!', '2006-07-20 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2646320, 358619, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice photo; I like the contrast between the brooding overcast sky and the lighter, almost serene grass and stationary fenceposts.  The clouds are great.  Position of the posts in frame is good, and nice the way the image sweeps away to the left, drawing the eye into the background there.</td>', 'Nice photo; I like the contrast between the brooding overcast sky and the lighter, almost serene grass and stationary fenceposts.  The clouds are great.  Position of the posts in frame is good, and nice the way the image sweeps away to the left, drawing the eye into the background there.', '2006-07-21 14:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2652245, 358667, 60120, '<td valign="top">Bright beautiful colors...a polarized filter would reduce the glare.  Nice photo! Might consider capturing one car and or shooting from a closer angle.</td>', 'Bright beautiful colors...a polarized filter would reduce the glare.  Nice photo! Might consider capturing one car and or shooting from a closer angle.', '2006-07-23 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 0),
