(2905182, 357999, 34192, '<td valign="top">this probably would have been a 6 in a different challenge.  People were hunting for objects (like people) that they considered ''not stationary.''  That''s were your 1s and 2s came from.  Without those, you probably would have been over.  As for the picture itself, I disagree with the lone commenter wanting more detail - I think its great just the way it is.  A little too centered for my tastes but the image is really well taken.  The color tones work very nicely together; the lights are dispersed well enough through the blacks to keep the image balanced.  Excellent job!</td>', 'this probably would have been a 6 in a different challenge.  People were hunting for objects (like people) that they considered ''not stationary.''  That''s were your 1s and 2s came from.  Without those, you probably would have been over.  As for the picture itself, I disagree with the lone commenter wanting more detail - I think its great just the way it is.  A little too centered for my tastes but the image is really well taken.  The color tones work very nicely together; the lights are dispersed well enough through the blacks to keep the image balanced.  Excellent job!', '2006-10-07 07:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2926802, 357999, 7810, '<td valign="top">This definetly should have placed higher. I really like this shot. The tone, the contrast. Nice work here</td>', 'This definetly should have placed higher. I really like this shot. The tone, the contrast. Nice work here', '2006-10-13 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2946618, 356344, 54228, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve done a fantastic job here, I may be biassed as I love battleships... but there is amazing detail in this image and the crop is just perfect.</td>', 'I think you''ve done a fantastic job here, I may be biassed as I love battleships... but there is amazing detail in this image and the crop is just perfect.', '2006-10-20 09:46:50.000000', NULL, 0),
